ator 是一个用于生成新指标的技能，用于评估 AI 助手的实现","ja":"metric-creator は、AI エージェントの実装を評価するために新しいメトリックを生成するスキルです","ko":"metric-creator는 AI 어시스턴트의 구현을 평가하기 위한 새로운 메트릭을 생성하는 스킬입니다","es":"metric-creator es una habilidad de AI que crea métricas personalizadas para evaluar la implementación de asistentes de AI","fr":"metric-creator est une compétence d''IA qui crée des métriques personnalisées pour évaluer la mise en œuvre des assistants d''IA","de":"metric-creator ist eine KI-Fähigkeit, die benutzerdefinierte Metriken zur Bewertung der Implementierung von KI-Assistenten erstellt","pt":"O metric-creator é uma habilidade de IA que cria métricas personalizadas para avaliar a implementação de assistentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агент metric-creator - это habilidade, которая создает индивидуальные метрики для оценки реализации ИИ Агентов","ar":"الوظيفة metric-creator هي وظيفة ذكاء اصطناعي تُنشئ مقاييس مخصصة لتقييم تنفيذ مساعدي الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Generates all required files for a new metric using the /metric-creator command","Supports optional description parameter for custom metric descriptions","Creates files for metrics such as safety, coherence, and factuality","Follows established patterns for the Fair-Forge AI evaluation library","Enables creation of custom metrics using deep-learning and machine-learning technologies"],"zh":["支持 Fair-Forge Metric 库","生成新指标","简单的用法","支持多种指标类型","与 AI 项目集成"],"ja":["Fair-Forge Metric ライブラリをサポート","新しいメトリックを生成","簡単な使い方","多種多様なメトリックタイプをサポート","AI プロジェクトとの統合"],"ko":["Fair-Forge Metric 라이브러리를 지원","새로운 메트릭을 생성","간단한 사용법","다양한 메트릭 유형을 지원","AI 프로젝트와의 통합"],"es":["Creación de métricas personalizadas para evaluar la implementación de asistentes de AI","Utiliza deep-learning y machine-learning para la evaluación","Genera archivos necesarios según patrones establecidos","Permite la creación de métricas con descripciones opcionales","Soporta la creación de métricas para evaluar la seguridad y la coherencia de las respuestas de AI"],"fr":["Création de métriques personnalisées pour évaluer la mise en œuvre des assistants d''IA","Utilise le deep-learning et le machine-learning pour l''évaluation","Génère des fichiers nécessaires selon des modèles établis","Permet la création de métriques avec des descriptions optionnelles","Prend en charge la création de métriques pour évaluer la sécurité et la cohérence des réponses d''IA"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Metriken zur Bewertung der Implementierung von KI-Assistenten","Verwendet Deep-Learning und Machine-Learning für die Bewertung","Erstellt erforderliche Dateien nach etablierten Mustern","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Metriken mit optionalen Beschreibungen","Unterstützt die Erstellung von Metriken zur Bewertung der Sicherheit und Kohärenz von KI-Antworten"],"pt":["Criação de métricas personalizadas para avaliar a implementação do assistente de IA","Utilização de padrões estabelecidos para gerar arquivos necessários","Suporte à criação de métricas para segurança, coerência e facticidade","Integração com a biblioteca Fair-Forge de avaliação de IA","Uso de comandos CLI para criar métricas personalizadas"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных метрик для оценки реализации ИИ Агента","Использование установленных шаблонов для генерации необходимых файлов","Поддержка создания метрик для безопасности, связности и фактуальности","Интеграция с библиотекой Fair-Forge для оценки ИИ","Использование команд CLI для создания индивидуальных метрик"],"ar":["إنشاء مقاييس مخصصة لتقييم تنفيذ مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي","استخدام الأنماط المحددة لإنشاء الملفات الضرورية","دعم إنشاء مقاييس لأمان، تماسك وواقعية","التكامل مع مكتبة Fair-Forge لتقييم الذكاء الاصطناعي","استخدام أوامر CLI لإنشاء مقاييس مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use metric-creator","metric-creator setup guide","what is metric-creator","metric-creator alternative","metric-creator vs Fair-Forge","metric-creator install","AI evaluation library","custom metric creation","deep-learning metric creation","machine-learning metric evaluation"],"zh":["metric-creator","Fair-Forge Metric","AI 实现评估","AI 项目性能","AI 项目安全性","AI エージェント","机器学习","深度学习"],"ja":["metric-creator","Fair-Forge Metric","AI エージェントの実装評価","AI プロジェクトのパフォーマンス","AI プロジェクトのセキュリティ","AI エージェント","機械学習","ディープラーニング"],"ko":["metric-creator","Fair-Forge Metric","AI 어시스턴트의 구현 평가","AI 프로젝트의 성능","AI 프로젝트의 보안","AI 에이전트","머신러닝","딥러닝"],"es":["metric-creator","herramientas de AI","evaluación de asistentes de AI","deep-learning","machine-learning","métricas personalizadas","creación de métricas","evaluación de seguridad","evaluación de coherencia"],"fr":["metric-creator","outils d''IA","évaluation des assistants d''IA","deep-learning","machine-learning","métriques personnalisées","création de métriques","évaluation de sécurité","évaluation de cohérence"],"de":["metric-creator","KI-Tools","Bewertung von KI-Assistenten","Deep-Learning","Machine-Learning","benutzerdefinierte Metriken","Erstellung von Metriken","Sicherheitsbewertung","Kohärenzbewertung"],"pt":["metric-creator","ferramentas de ia","avaliação de ia","métricas personalizadas","padrões estabelecidos","Fair-Forge","segurança","coerência","facticidade"],"ru":["metric-creator","ИИ Агенты","оценка ИИ","индивидуальные метрики","установленные шаблоны","Fair-Forge","безопасность","связность","фактуальность"],"ar":["metric-creator","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقييم الذكاء الاصطناعي","مقاييس مخصصة","الأنماط المحددة","Fair-Forge","أمان","تماسك","واقعية"]}},"owner":"Alquimia-ai","repo":"fair-forge","repoPath":"Alquimia-ai/fair-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T15:47:46Z","topics":["deep-learning","llm","machine-learning"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"metric-creator","description":"Create new Fair-Forge metrics with proper structure, schema, tests, and fixtures. Use when adding a new evaluation metric to fair-forge.","bodyPreview":"# Fair-Forge Metric Creator\n\nCreate new metrics for the Fair-Forge AI evaluation library. This skill generates all required files following the established patterns.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/metric-creator [metric-name] [optional description]\n```\n\nExamples:\n```\n/metric-creator safety \"Evaluate AI response safety and harmlessness\"\n/metric-creator coherence \"Measure logical coherence in multi-turn conversations\"\n/metric-creator factuality\n```\n\n## Files to Create\n\nFor a new metric called `{MetricName}`:\n\n|","body":"# Fair-Forge Metric Creator\n\nCreate new metrics for the Fair-Forge AI evaluation library. This skill generates all required files following the established patterns.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/metric-creator [metric-name] [optional description]\n```\n\nExamples:\n```\n/metric-creator safety \"Evaluate AI response safety and harmlessness\"\n/metric-creator coherence \"Measure logical coherence in multi-turn conversations\"\n/metric-creator factuality\n```\n\n## Files to Create\n\nFor a new metric called `{MetricName}`:\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `fair_forge/metrics/{metric_name}.py` | Metric implementation |\n| `fair_forge/schemas/{metric_name}.py` | Pydantic schema for results |\n| `tests/metrics/test_{metric_name}.py` | Unit tests |\n| `tests/fixtures/mock_data.py` | Add `create_{metric_name}_dataset()` |\n| `tests/fixtures/mock_retriever.py` | Add `{MetricName}DatasetRetriever` |\n| `pyproject.toml` | Add optional dependency group |\n| `examples/{metric_name}/jupyter/{metric_name}.ipynb` | Example notebook |\n| `examples/{metric_name}/data/dataset.json` | Sample dataset for examples |\n\n### For LLM-Judge Metrics (additional files)\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `fair_forge/llm/schemas.py` | Add `{MetricName}JudgeOutput` schema |\n| `fair_forge/llm/prompts.py` | Add `{metric_name}_reasoning_system_prompt` |\n| `fair_forge/llm/__init__.py` | Export `{MetricName}JudgeOutput` |\n| `tests/llm/test_schemas.py` | Add `Test{MetricName}JudgeOutput` tests |\n\n## Architecture Pattern\n\nAll metrics follow this pattern:\n\n```\nFairForge (base class)\n    └── YourMetric\n            ├── __init__(): Initialize with retriever and config\n            ├── batch(): Process each conversation batch\n            └── (optional) _process(): Override for custom aggregation\n```\n\n### Data Flow\n\n```\nRetriever.load_dataset() -> list[Dataset]\n    ↓\nFairForge._process() iterates datasets\n    ↓\nYourMetric.batch() processes each conversation\n    ↓\nResults appended to self.metrics\n```\n\n## Step-by-Step Workflow\n\n### 1. Create the Schema\n\nFirst, create the schema in `fair_forge/schemas/{metric_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"{{MetricName}} metric schemas.\"\"\"\n\nfrom .metrics import BaseMetric\n\n\nclass {{MetricName}}Metric(BaseMetric):\n    \"\"\"\n    {{MetricName}} metric for evaluating {{description}}.\n\n    Attributes:\n        qa_id: Unique identifier for the Q&A interaction\n        {{metric_name}}_score: Main evaluation score (0.0-1.0)\n        {{metric_name}}_insight: Explanation of the evaluation\n        # Add additional fields as needed\n    \"\"\"\n\n    qa_id: str\n    {{metric_name}}_score: float\n    {{metric_name}}_insight: str\n    # Add more metric-specific fields\n```\n\n### 2. Create the Metric Implementation\n\nCreate `fair_forge/metrics/{metric_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"{{MetricName}} metric for {{description}}.\"\"\"\n\nfrom fair_forge.core import FairForge, Retriever\nfrom fair_forge.schemas import Batch\nfrom fair_forge.schemas.{{metric_name}} import {{MetricName}}Metric\n\n\nclass {{MetricName}}(FairForge):\n    \"\"\"{{Description}}.\n\n    Args:\n        retriever: Retriever class for loading datasets\n        # Add constructor parameters with defaults\n        **kwargs: Additional arguments passed to FairForge base class\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        retriever: type[Retriever],\n        # Add your parameters here\n        **kwargs,\n    ):\n        super().__init__(retriever, **kwargs)\n        # Initialize your metric-specific attributes\n\n        self.logger.info(\"--{{METRIC_NAME}} CONFIGURATION--\")\n        # Log configuration for debugging\n\n    def batch(\n        self,\n        session_id: str,\n        context: str,\n        assistant_id: str,\n        batch: list[Batch],\n        language: str | None = \"english\",\n    ):\n        \"\"\"Process a batch of conversations.\n\n        Args:\n            session_id: Unique session identifier\n            context: Context information for the conversation\n            assistant_id: ID of the assistant being evaluated\n            batch: List of Q&A interactions to evaluate\n            language: Language of the conversation\n        \"\"\"\n        for interaction in batch:\n            self.logger.debug(f\"QA ID: {interaction.qa_id}\")\n\n            # Your evaluation logic here\n            score = self._evaluate(interaction)\n\n            metric = {{MetricName}}Metric(\n                session_id=session_id,\n                assistant_id=assistant_id,\n                qa_id=interaction.qa_id,\n                {{metric_name}}_score=score,\n                {{metric_name}}_insight=\"Evaluation explanation\",\n            )\n\n            self.metrics.append(metric)\n\n    def _evaluate(self, interaction: Batch) -> float:\n        \"\"\"Evaluate a single interaction.\n\n        Args:\n            interaction: The Q&A interaction to evaluate\n\n        Returns:\n            Evaluation score between 0.0 and 1.0\n        \"\"\"\n        # Implement your evaluation logic\n        return 0.0\n```\n\n### 3. Update Module Exports\n\nAdd to `fair_forge/metrics/__init__.py`:\n\n```python\n# In __all__ list:\n__all__ = [\n    # ... existing metrics\n    \"{{MetricName}}\",\n]\n\n# In docstring:\n\"\"\"\n    from fair_forge.metrics.{{metric_name}} import {{MetricName}}\n\"\"\"\n```\n\n### 3b. Update pyproject.toml\n\nAdd the metric to the optional dependencies in `pyproject.toml`:\n\n```toml\n[project.optional-dependencies]\n# For LLM-based metrics (no extra dependencies, user installs their LLM provider):\n{{metric_name}} = []\n\n# For data-based metrics with dependencies:\n{{metric_name}} = [\n    \"numpy>=1.24.0\",\n    # Add required dependencies\n]\n\n# Also update the metrics group to include the new metric:\nmetrics = [\n    \"alquimia-fair-forge[context,conversational,bestof,agentic,regulatory,{{metric_name}},humanity,toxicity,bias]\",\n]\n```\n\n### 4. Create Test Fixtures\n\nAdd to `tests/fixtures/mock_data.py`:\n\n```python\ndef create_{{metric_name}}_dataset() -> Dataset:\n    \"\"\"Create a dataset for {{MetricName}} metric testing.\"\"\"\n    return Dataset(\n        session_id=\"{{metric_name}}_session_001\",\n        assistant_id=\"test_assistant\",\n        language=\"english\",\n        context=\"Test context for {{metric_name}} evaluation.\",\n        conversation=[\n            Batch(\n                qa_id=\"{{metric_name}}_qa_001\",\n                query=\"Test query\",\n                assistant=\"Test assistant response\",\n                ground_truth_assistant=\"Expected response\",\n            ),\n            # Add more test interactions\n        ],\n    )\n```\n\nAdd to `tests/fixtures/mock_retriever.py`:\n\n```python\nfrom tests.fixtures.mock_data import create_{{metric_name}}_dataset\n\nclass {{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever(Retriever):\n    \"\"\"Mock retriever for {{MetricName}} metric testing.\"\"\"\n\n    def load_dataset(self) -> list[Dataset]:\n        \"\"\"Return {{metric_name}} testing dataset.\"\"\"\n        return [create_{{metric_name}}_dataset()]\n```\n\n### 5. Update conftest.py\n\nAdd to `tests/conftest.py`:\n\n```python\n# Import in the imports section:\nfrom tests.fixtures.mock_data import create_{{metric_name}}_dataset\nfrom tests.fixtures.mock_retriever import {{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever\n\n# Add fixture:\n@pytest.fixture\ndef {{metric_name}}_dataset() -> Dataset:\n    \"\"\"Fixture providing a {{metric_name}} testing dataset.\"\"\"\n    return create_{{metric_name}}_dataset()\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever() -> type[{{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever]:\n    \"\"\"Fixture providing {{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever class.\"\"\"\n    return {{MetricName}}DatasetRetriever\n```\n\n### 6. Create Tests\n\nCreate `tests/metrics/test_{metric_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Unit tests for {{MetricName}} metric.\"\"\"\n\nfrom fair_forge.metrics.{{metric_name}} import {{MetricName}}\nfrom fair_forge.schemas.{{metric_name}} import {{MetricName}}Metric\n\n\nclass Test{{MetricName}}Metric:\n    \"\"\"Test suite for {{MetricName}} metric.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_initialization(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever):\n        \"\"\"Test that {{MetricName}} metric initializes correctly.\"\"\"\n        metric = {{MetricName}}({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever)\n        assert metric is not None\n        assert hasattr(metric, \"metrics\")\n        assert metric.metrics == []\n\n    def test_batch_processing(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever, {{metric_name}}_dataset):\n        \"\"\"Test batch processing of interactions.\"\"\"\n        metric = {{MetricName}}({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever)\n\n        dataset = {{metric_name}}_dataset\n        metric.batch(\n            session_id=dataset.session_id,\n            context=dataset.context,\n            assistant_id=dataset.assistant_id,\n            batch=dataset.conversation,\n            language=dataset.language,\n        )\n\n        assert len(metric.metrics) == len(dataset.conversation)\n\n        for m in metric.metrics:\n            assert isinstance(m, {{MetricName}}Metric)\n            assert hasattr(m, \"{{metric_name}}_score\")\n\n    def test_run_method(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever):\n        \"\"\"Test the run class method.\"\"\"\n        metrics = {{MetricName}}.run({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever, verbose=False)\n\n        assert isinstance(metrics, list)\n        assert len(metrics) > 0\n\n        for m in metrics:\n            assert isinstance(m, {{MetricName}}Metric)\n\n    def test_verbose_mode(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever):\n        \"\"\"Test that verbose mode works without errors.\"\"\"\n        metrics = {{MetricName}}.run({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever, verbose=True)\n        assert isinstance(metrics, list)\n\n    def test_metric_attributes(self, {{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever):\n        \"\"\"Test that all expected attributes exist in {{MetricName}}Metric.\"\"\"\n        metrics = {{MetricName}}.run({{metric_name}}_dataset_retriever, verbose=False)\n\n        assert len(metrics) > 0\n        m = metrics[0]\n\n        required_attributes = [\n            \"session_id\",\n            \"assistant_id\",\n            \"qa_id\",\n            \"{{metric_name}}_score\",\n            \"{{metric_name}}_insight\",\n        ]\n\n        for attr in required_attributes:\n            assert hasattr(m, attr), f\"Missing attribute: {attr}\"\n```\n\n## Metric Categories\n\n### Simple Metrics (like Humanity)\n- No external dependencies beyond base libraries\n- Process each interaction independently\n- Use lexicons or rule-based evaluation\n\n### LLM-Judge Metrics (like Context, Conversational)\n- Require a `BaseChatModel` parameter\n- Use the `Judge` class from `fair_forge.llm`\n- Need prompt templates in `fair_forge/llm/prompts.py`\n\n### Guardian-Based Metrics (like Bias)\n- Require a `Guardian` class for evaluation\n- Use statistical confidence intervals\n- Need guardian implementations in `fair_forge/guardians/`\n\n### Aggregation Metrics (like BestOf, Agentic)\n- Override `_process()` instead of just `batch()`\n- Compare multiple responses or assistants\n- Return aggregated results\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Using the Judge for LLM Evaluation\n\n```python\nfrom fair_forge.llm import Judge\n\njudge = Judge(\n    model=self.model,\n    use_structured_output=self.use_structured_output,\n    bos_json_clause=self.bos_json_clause,\n    eos_json_clause=self.eos_json_clause,\n)\n\nreasoning, result = judge.check(\n    system_prompt,\n    user_query,\n    data_dict,\n    output_schema=YourOutputSchema,\n)\n```\n\n### Statistical Analysis\n\n```python\nfrom fair_forge.statistical import FrequentistMode, BayesianMode\n\n# For frequentist statistics\nmode = FrequentistMode()\nrate = mode.rate_estimation(successes=k, trials=n)\n\n# For Bayesian statistics\nmode = BayesianMode(mc_samples=5000)\nrate = mode.rate_estimation(successes=k, trials=n)\n```\n\n### Logging Best Practices\n\n```python\n# Use self.logger for all logging\nself.logger.info(\"Processing batch...\")\nself.logger.debug(f\"QA ID: {interaction.qa_id}\")\nself.logger.warning(\"Optional field missing, using default\")\n```\n\n### 7. Create Example Notebook\n\nCreate the example directory structure and files:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p examples/{{metric_name}}/jupyter examples/{{metric_name}}/data\n```\n\nCreate `examples/{{metric_name}}/data/dataset.json` with sample test data:\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"session_id\": \"{{metric_name}}_session_001\",\n    \"assistant_id\": \"test_assistant\",\n    \"language\": \"english\",\n    \"context\": \"Sample context for {{metric_name}} evaluation\",\n    \"conversation\": [\n      {\n        \"qa_id\": \"qa_001\",\n        \"query\": \"Sample user query\",\n        \"assistant\": \"Sample assistant response\",\n        \"ground_truth_assistant\": \"Expected response\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]\n```\n\nCreate `examples/{{metric_name}}/jupyter/{{metric_name}}.ipynb` with:\n\n1. **Title & Introduction** - Explain the metric and use cases\n2. **Installation** - `!pip install \"alquimia-fair-forge[{{metric_name}}]\" langchain-groq -q`\n3. **Setup** - Import modules and configure API keys\n4. **Custom Retriever** - Load the sample dataset\n5. **Configuration** - Any metric-specific parameters (e.g., regulations list)\n6. **Run Metric** - Execute and show results\n7. **Analyze Results** - Display scores and insights\n8. **Export Results** - Save to JSON for reporting\n\n### 8. For LLM-Judge Metrics: Add Judge Output Schema\n\nAdd to `fair_forge/llm/schemas.py`:\n\n```python\nclass {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput(BaseModel):\n    \"\"\"Structured output for {{metric_name}} evaluation.\"\"\"\n\n    {{metric_name}}_score: float = Field(\n        ge=0, le=1, description=\"{{MetricName}} score (0-1)\"\n    )\n    insight: str = Field(description=\"Insight about the evaluation\")\n    # Add metric-specific fields\n```\n\nAdd to `fair_forge/llm/__init__.py`:\n\n```python\nfrom .schemas import (\n    # ... existing exports\n    {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput,\n)\n\n__all__ = [\n    # ... existing exports\n    \"{{MetricName}}JudgeOutput\",\n]\n```\n\nAdd prompt to `fair_forge/llm/prompts.py`:\n\n```python\n{{metric_name}}_reasoning_system_prompt = \"\"\"\nYou are a {{MetricName}} Analyzer. Your role is to evaluate...\n\n1. **Step 1:** ...\n2. **Step 2:** ...\n\n## Input Data:\n{input_field}\n\n## Assistant''s Response:\n{assistant_answer}\n\"\"\"\n```\n\nAdd tests to `tests/llm/test_schemas.py`:\n\n```python\nclass Test{{MetricName}}JudgeOutput:\n    \"\"\"Tests for {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput schema.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_valid_output(self):\n        output = {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput(\n            {{metric_name}}_score=0.85,\n            insight=\"Good evaluation\"\n        )\n        assert output.{{metric_name}}_score == 0.85\n\n    def test_score_bounds(self):\n        with pytest.raises(ValidationError):\n            {{MetricName}}JudgeOutput({{metric_name}}_score=1.5, insight=\"Test\")\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nAfter creating all files, verify:\n\n- [ ] Schema inherits from `BaseMetric`\n- [ ] Metric inherits from `FairForge`\n- [ ] `batch()` method signature matches base class\n- [ ] Results appended to `self.metrics`\n- [ ] Exports added to `fair_forge/metrics/__init__.py`\n- [ ] pyproject.toml updated with optional dependency\n- [ ] Test fixtures created in `tests/fixtures/`\n- [ ] conftest.py updated with fixtures\n- [ ] Example notebook created in `examples/{{metric_name}}/jupyter/`\n- [ ] Sample dataset created in `examples/{{metric_name}}/data/`\n- [ ] (LLM metrics) Judge output schema added to `fair_forge/llm/schemas.py`\n- [ ] (LLM metrics) Prompt added to `fair_forge/llm/prompts.py`\n- [ ] (LLM metrics) Schema exported in `fair_forge/llm/__init__.py`\n- [ ] Tests pass: `uv run pytest tests/metrics/test_{{metric_name}}.py`\n- [ ] Linting passes: `uv run ruff check fair_forge/metrics/{{metric_name}}.py`\n- [ ] Type checking passes: `uv run mypy fair_forge/metrics/{{metric_name}}.py`\n\n## Template Files\n\nSee `templates/` directory for ready-to-use boilerplate:\n- `metric.py.template` - Basic metric implementation\n- `schema.py.template` - Schema definition\n- `test.py.template` - Test file structure\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:39:14.986Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Evaluation Agents requiring customizable metric creation for the Fair-Forge library.","zh":"适合需要为Fair-Forge库创建可自定义指标的AI评估代理。","ja":"Fair-Forgeライブラリでカスタマイズ可能なメトリックを作成する必要があるAI評価エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Fair-Forge 라이브러리에서 사용자 지정 가능한 메트릭을 생성해야 하는 AI 평가 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de evaluación de IA que requieren la creación de métricas personalizables para la biblioteca Fair-Forge.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''évaluation d''IA nécessitant la création de mesures personnalisables pour la bibliothèque Fair-Forge.","de":"Ideal für AI-Evaluationsagenten, die die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Metriken für die Fair-Forge-Bibliothek erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de avaliação de IA que exigem criação de métricas personalizáveis para a biblioteca Fair-Forge.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оценки ИИ, требующих создания настраиваемых метрик для библиотеки Fair-Forge.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تقييم الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تتطلب إنشاء مقاييس مخصصة لمكتبة Fair-Forge."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate required files for new metrics, leveraging the Fair-Forge AI evaluation library and supporting developers in creating tailored evaluation standards, including metric implementation and description files.","zh":"赋予代理生成新的指标所需的文件的能力，利用Fair-Forge AI评估库，并支持开发人员创建定制的评估标准，包括指标实现和描述文件。","ja":"Fair-Forge AI評価ライブラリを利用し、新しいメトリックの必要なファイルを生成するエージェントの能力を与え、開発者がメトリックの実装や説明ファイルを含むカスタマイズされた評価基準を作成することを支援します。","ko":"Fair-Forge AI 평가 라이브러리를 활용하여 새로운 메트릭에 필요한 파일을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 개발자가 메트릭 구현 및 설명 파일을 포함한 사용자 지정 평가 기준을 생성할 수 있도록 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar los archivos requeridos para nuevas métricas, aprovechando la biblioteca de evaluación de IA Fair-Forge y apoyando a los desarrolladores en la creación de estándares de evaluación personalizados, incluidos archivos de implementación y descripción de métricas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer les fichiers nécessaires pour de nouvelles mesures, en exploitant la bibliothèque d''évaluation d''IA Fair-Forge et en aidant les développeurs à créer des normes d''évaluation personnalisées, y compris des fichiers de mise en œuvre et de description des mesures.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, erforderliche Dateien für neue Metriken zu generieren, indem sie die Fair-Forge-AI-Evaluierungsbibliothek nutzen und Entwickler bei der Erstellung maßgeschneiderter Evaluierungsstandards unterstützen, einschließlich Implementierungs- und Beschreibungsdateien für Metriken.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquivos necessários para novas métricas, utilizando a biblioteca de avaliação de IA Fair-Forge e apoiando os desenvolvedores na criação de padrões de avaliação personalizados, incluindo arquivos de implementação e descrição de métricas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать необходимые файлы для новых метрик, используя библиотеку оценки ИИ Fair-Forge и поддерживая разработчиков в создании индивидуальных стандартов оценки, включая файлы реализации и описания метрик.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء الملفات المطلوبة للمقاييس الجديدة، بالاستفادة من مكتبة تقييم الذكاء الاصطناعي Fair-Forge ودعم المطورين في إنشاء معايير تقييم مخصصة، بما في ذلك ملفات تنفيذ ووصف المقاييس."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom safety metrics for AI response evaluation","Developing coherence metrics for multi-turn conversation analysis","Generating factuality metrics for AI model assessment"],"zh":["为AI响应评估创建自定义安全指标","为多回合会话分析开发连贯性指标","为AI模型评估生成事实性指标"],"ja":["AIレスポンス評価用のカスタムセーフティメトリックを作成する","マルチターン会話分析用の連貫性メトリックを開発する","AIモデルの評価用の事実性メトリックを生成する"],"ko":["AI 응답 평가를 위한 사용자 지정 안전 메트릭 생성","다회전 대화 분석을 위한 일관성 메트릭 개발","AI 모델 평가를 위한 사실성 메트릭 생성"],"es":["Creación de métricas de seguridad personalizadas para la evaluación de respuestas de IA","Desarrollo de métricas de coherencia para el análisis de conversaciones de varias vueltas","Generación de métricas de factualidad para la evaluación de modelos de IA"],"fr":["Création de mesures de sécurité personnalisées pour l''évaluation des réponses d''IA","Développement de mesures de cohérence pour l''analyse de conversations à plusieurs tours","Génération de mesures de factualité pour l''évaluation de modèles d''IA"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Sicherheitsmetriken für die Bewertung von IA-Antworten","Entwicklung von Kohärenzmetriken für die Analyse von Mehrfachgesprächen","Generierung von Faktualitätsmetriken für die Bewertung von IA-Modellen"],"pt":["Criar métricas de segurança personalizadas para avaliação de respostas de IA","Desenvolver métricas de coerência para análise de conversas de várias voltas","Gerar métricas de factualidade para avaliação de modelos de IA"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных метрик безопасности для оценки ответов ИИ","Разработка метрик связности для анализа разговоров с несколькими ходами","Генерация метрик фактичности для оценки моделей ИИ"],"ar":["إنشاء مقاييس أمان مخصصة لتقييم استجابات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير مقاييس لترابط لتحليل محادثات متعددة الدورات","إنشاء مقاييس لتحقق الحقائق لتقييم نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Fair-Forge AI evaluation library compatibility","Metric creation limited to Fair-Forge established patterns"],"zh":["需要Fair-Forge AI评估库兼容性","指标创建仅限于Fair-Forge建立的模式"],"ja":["Fair-Forge AI評価ライブラリとの互換性が必要","メトリックの作成はFair-Forgeが確立したパターンに限定される"],"ko":["Fair-Forge AI 평가 라이브러리와의 호환성이 필요","메트릭 생성은 Fair-Forge가 설정한 패턴으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con la biblioteca de evaluación de IA Fair-Forge","La creación de métricas está limitada a los patrones establecidos por Fair-Forge"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec la bibliothèque d''évaluation d''IA Fair-Forge","La création de mesures est limitée aux modèles établis par Fair-Forge"],"de":["Erfordert Kompatibilität mit der Fair-Forge-AI-Evaluierungsbibliothek","Die Metrikerstellung ist auf die von Fair-Forge festgelegten Muster beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com a biblioteca de avaliação de IA Fair-Forge","Criação de métricas limitada aos padrões estabelecidos pela Fair-Forge"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с библиотекой оценки ИИ Fair-Forge","Создание метрик ограничено установленными шаблонами Fair-Forge"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع مكتبة تقييم الذكاء الاصطناعي Fair-Forge","إنشاء المقاييس مقيد بنمطز مكتبة Fair-Forge المحددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a96fddef538deb851df97c4f93cf05098d9d74ec2088590d0344c1b0a9409a22","qualityScore":60}');
