れたルートへのアクセスを許可するプロセスです","ko":"인증은 사용자의 身分을 검증하고 보호된 경로에 대한 접근을 허용하는 프로세스입니다","es":"La autenticación es el proceso de verificar la identidad de un usuario o servicio para acceder a recursos protegidos","fr":"L''authentification est le processus de vérification de l''identité d''un utilisateur ou d''un service pour accéder à des ressources protégées","de":"Die Authentifizierung ist der Prozess der Überprüfung der Identität eines Benutzers oder eines Dienstes, um auf geschützte Ressourcen zuzugreifen","pt":"Autenticação é o processo de verificar a identidade de um usuário ou sistema, garantindo acesso seguro às aplicações","ru":"Аутентификация - это процесс проверки идентификации пользователя или системы, обеспечивающий безопасный доступ к приложениям для ИИ Агентов","ar":"المصادقة هي عملية التحقق من هوية المستخدم أو النظام، مما يضمن الوصول الآمن إلى التطبيقات الإلكترونية"},"features":{"en":["Manages login flows and session management using Supabase sessions","Integrates Google OAuth for secure authentication and authorization","Supports protected route middleware for restricted access control","Enables domain-restricted access for secure data exchange","Provides secondary Google Drive OAuth integration for expanded functionality","Handles access control patterns for fine-grained permission management"],"zh":["支持Google OAuth和Supabase会话","登录流和会话管理","保护路由中间件","域限制访问","OAuth集成"],"ja":["Google OAuthとSupabaseセッションをサポート","ログインフローとセッション管理","保護されたルートの中間ウェア","ドメイン制限アクセス","OAuth統合"],"ko":["Google OAuth 및 Supabase 세션 지원","로그인 흐름 및 세션 관리","보호된 경로 미들웨어","도메인 제한 접근","OAuth 통합"],"es":["Flujos de inicio de sesión con OAuth","Gestión de sesiones con Supabase","Protección de rutas con middleware de autenticación","Integración con Google Drive OAuth","Control de acceso basado en dominios","Patrones de control de acceso"],"fr":["Flux de connexion avec OAuth","Gestion de sessions avec Supabase","Protection de routes avec middleware d''authentification","Intégration avec Google Drive OAuth","Contrôle d''accès basé sur les domaines","Modèles de contrôle d''accès"],"de":["Login-Flows mit OAuth","Sitzungsmanagement mit Supabase","Routenschutz mit Authentifizierungsmiddleware","Integration mit Google Drive OAuth","Zugriffskontrolle basierend auf Domains","Zugriffskontrollmuster"],"pt":["Login e fluxos de autenticação","Gerenciamento de sessões","Middleware de rotas protegidas","Integração com OAuth","Acesso restrito por domínio","Autenticação do Google Drive"],"ru":["Вход и потоки аутентификации","Управление сессиями","Промежуточное ПО защищенных маршрутов","Интеграция с OAuth для ИИ Агентов","Доступ, ограниченный по домену","Аутентификация Google Drive"],"ar":["عمليات التسجيل والتحقق","إدارة الجلسات","برنامج وسيط للطرق المحمية","التكامل مع OAuth","الوصول المقيد بالمنطقة","مصادقة محرك جوجل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use authentication in AI agents","what is authentication in software development","authentication vs authorization in AI","authentication setup guide for developers","Google OAuth integration for AI agents","Supabase sessions for secure login flows","protected route middleware for AI authentication","authentication alternative for AI developers","installing authentication for AI agents","authentication best practices for software development"],"zh":["AIエージェント身份验证","登录流管理","会话管理","OAuth集成","Google OAuth","Supabase会话","保护路由中间件","域限制访问"],"ja":["AIエージェントの認証","ログインフロー管理","セッション管理","OAuth統合","Google OAuth","Supabaseセッション","保護されたルートの中間ウェア","ドメイン制限アクセス"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 인증","로그인 흐름 관리","세션 관리","OAuth 통합","Google OAuth","Supabase 세션","보호된 경로 미들웨어","도메인 제한 접근"],"es":["autenticación con OAuth","gestión de sesiones con Supabase","protección de rutas","control de acceso","autenticación de Google Drive","patrones de autenticación","desarrollo de aplicaciones seguras","seguridad de la autenticación"],"fr":["authentification avec OAuth","gestion de sessions avec Supabase","protection de routes","contrôle d''accès","authentification de Google Drive","modèles d''authentification","développement d''applications sécurisées","sécurité de l''authentification"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit OAuth","Sitzungsmanagement mit Supabase","Routenschutz","Zugriffskontrolle","Authentifizierung von Google Drive","Authentifizierungsmuster","Entwicklung sicherer Anwendungen","Authentifizierungssicherheit"],"pt":["autenticação de desenvolvedores","guias de configuração de autenticação","login e sessões","OAuth e autenticação","acesso restrito por domínio","autenticação do Google Drive","desenvolvedores de aplicações","segurança de aplicações"],"ru":["аутентификация для разработчиков ИИ Агентов","настройка аутентификации","вход и сессии","OAuth и аутентификация для ИИ Агентов","доступ, ограниченный по домену","аутентификация Google Drive","разработчики приложений","безопасность приложений для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["مصادقة التطبيقات الإلكترونية","دليل إعداد المصادقة","عمليات التسجيل والجلسات","OAuth والمصادقة","الوصول المقيد بالمنطقة","مصادقة محرك جوجل","مطورو التطبيقات الإلكترونية","أمن التطبيقات الإلكترونية"]}},"owner":"juanjaragavi","repo":"social-media-genius","repoPath":"juanjaragavi/social-media-genius","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T23:26:39Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"authentication","description":"Auth flows, session management, OAuth integration, domain-restricted access, and role-based access control for TopNetworks properties. Primary implementation is Better Auth 1.x with Google OAuth in route-genius. Use when implementing login, session checks, protected routes, or any access control logic.","bodyPreview":"# Authentication — TopNetworks, Inc.\n\nThis skill governs all authentication and authorization work. Derived from route-genius (Better Auth 1.x + Google OAuth + Supabase sessions) as the canonical full-stack auth implementation in the workspace.\n\n---\n\n## Scope\n\n**Use for:** Login flows, session management, protected route middleware, OAuth integration, domain-restricted access, Google Drive OAuth (secondary), and access control patterns.\n\n**Not for:** Database RLS configuration (see `database` sk","body":"# Authentication — TopNetworks, Inc.\n\nThis skill governs all authentication and authorization work. Derived from route-genius (Better Auth 1.x + Google OAuth + Supabase sessions) as the canonical full-stack auth implementation in the workspace.\n\n---\n\n## Scope\n\n**Use for:** Login flows, session management, protected route middleware, OAuth integration, domain-restricted access, Google Drive OAuth (secondary), and access control patterns.\n\n**Not for:** Database RLS configuration (see `database` skill), general API route design (see `backend` skill), or AdZep ad network integration (that is a separate concern — see project instruction files).\n\n---\n\n## Auth Stack by Project\n\n| Project                              | Auth Method       | Provider                   | Session Storage       |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----------------- | -------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| route-genius                         | Better Auth 1.x   | Google OAuth 2.0           | PostgreSQL (Supabase) |\n| topfinanzas-\\* (financial platforms) | No authentication | N/A — public content sites | N/A                   |\n| emailgenius-broadcasts-generator     | Internal tool     | GCP service account        | N/A                   |\n| arbitrage-manager-dashboard          | Internal tool     | GCP IAM / service accounts | N/A                   |\n\nFinancial content platforms (topfinanzas-us-next, uk-topfinanzas-com, budgetbee-next, kardtrust) are **public-facing and have no user authentication**. They do not implement login, sessions, or protected routes.\n\n---\n\n## Better Auth — Route-Genius Implementation\n\n### Installation & Setup\n\n```bash\nnpm install better-auth pg\n```\n\n```typescript\n// lib/auth.ts — server-side auth configuration\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\nimport { Pool } from \"pg\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  database: new Pool({\n    connectionString: process.env.DATABASE_URL,\n  }),\n\n  socialProviders: {\n    google: {\n      clientId: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID!,\n      clientSecret: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n    },\n  },\n\n  // Domain restriction — only @topnetworks.co and @topfinanzas.com allowed\n  user: {\n    additionalFields: {},\n  },\n\n  // Trusted origins (must match deployment environments)\n  trustedOrigins: [\n    \"http://localhost:3070\",\n    \"https://route-genius.vercel.app\",\n    \"https://route.topnetworks.co\",\n  ],\n\n  session: {\n    expiresIn: 60 * 60 * 24 * 7, // 7 days\n    updateAge: 60 * 60 * 24, // Refresh daily\n    cookieCache: {\n      enabled: true,\n      maxAge: 5 * 60, // 5-minute cookie cache\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// lib/auth-client.ts — client-side auth configuration\nimport { createAuthClient } from \"better-auth/react\";\n\nexport const authClient = createAuthClient({\n  baseURL: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL ?? \"http://localhost:3070\",\n});\n\nexport const { signIn, signOut, useSession } = authClient;\n```\n\n### API Route Handler\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/auth/[...all]/route.ts\nimport { auth } from \"@/lib/auth\";\nimport { toNextJsHandler } from \"better-auth/next-js\";\n\nexport const { GET, POST } = toNextJsHandler(auth);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Domain Restriction\n\nOnly `@topnetworks.co` and `@topfinanzas.com` email domains are permitted. This is enforced at the application level in `lib/auth.ts` using Better Auth''s callback hooks:\n\n```typescript\n// lib/auth.ts — domain restriction implementation\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  // ...base config...\n\n  hooks: {\n    after: [\n      {\n        matcher(context) {\n          return context.path === \"/sign-in/social/callback\";\n        },\n        handler: async (ctx) => {\n          const email = ctx.context?.session?.user?.email ?? \"\";\n          const allowedDomains = [\"@topnetworks.co\", \"@topfinanzas.com\"];\n          const isAllowed = allowedDomains.some((domain) =>\n            email.endsWith(domain),\n          );\n\n          if (!isAllowed) {\n            // Sign out the user and redirect to login with error\n            await auth.api.signOut({ headers: ctx.request.headers });\n            return Response.redirect(\n              `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/login?error=unauthorized_domain`,\n            );\n          }\n        },\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Session Management\n\n### Server-Side Session Access\n\n```typescript\n// lib/auth-session.ts\nimport { auth } from \"./auth\";\nimport { headers } from \"next/headers\";\nimport { redirect } from \"next/navigation\";\n\n// Use in Server Components and Server Actions\nexport async function getServerSession() {\n  const session = await auth.api.getSession({\n    headers: await headers(),\n  });\n  return session;\n}\n\n// Auth guard — use at the top of every Server Action\nexport async function requireUserId(): Promise<string> {\n  const session = await getServerSession();\n  if (!session?.user?.id) {\n    redirect(\"/login\");\n  }\n  return session.user.id;\n}\n\n// Auth guard — use in Server Components (doesn''t redirect, returns null)\nexport async function getOptionalSession() {\n  const session = await getServerSession();\n  return session?.user ?? null;\n}\n```\n\n### Client-Side Session Access\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\nimport { useSession } from \"@/lib/auth-client\";\n\nexport function UserAvatar() {\n  const { data: session, isPending } = useSession();\n\n  if (isPending) return <Skeleton />;\n  if (!session) return null;\n\n  return (\n    <img\n      src={session.user.image ?? \"/default-avatar.png\"}\n      alt={session.user.name}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Middleware Protection (proxy.ts)\n\nRoute-genius uses `proxy.ts` (Next.js 16 middleware convention). Next.js 15 projects use `middleware.ts`.\n\n```typescript\n// proxy.ts (route-genius — Next.js 16)\nimport { NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\nimport type { NextRequest } from \"next/server\";\n\n// Routes accessible without authentication\nconst PUBLIC_PATHS = [\n  \"/login\",\n  \"/api/auth\", // Better Auth endpoints\n  \"/api/redirect\", // Public redirect endpoint\n  \"/api/analytics\", // Public analytics API\n  \"/analytics\", // Public analytics pages\n  \"/privacy\",\n  \"/terms\",\n];\n\nexport function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n  const pathname = request.nextUrl.pathname;\n\n  const isPublic = PUBLIC_PATHS.some((p) => pathname.startsWith(p));\n  if (isPublic) return NextResponse.next();\n\n  // Cookie name varies by protocol:\n  // HTTPS: __Secure-better-auth.session_token\n  // HTTP (localhost): better-auth.session_token\n  const sessionCookie =\n    request.cookies.get(\"__Secure-better-auth.session_token\") ||\n    request.cookies.get(\"better-auth.session_token\");\n\n  if (!sessionCookie) {\n    const loginUrl = new URL(\"/login\", request.url);\n    loginUrl.searchParams.set(\"callbackUrl\", pathname);\n    return NextResponse.redirect(loginUrl);\n  }\n\n  // Redirect authenticated users away from /login\n  if (pathname === \"/login\") {\n    return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(\"/dashboard\", request.url));\n  }\n\n  return NextResponse.next();\n}\n\nexport const config = {\n  matcher: [\"/((?!_next/static|_next/image|favicon.ico|.*\\\\.png$).*)\"],\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Login Page Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// app/login/page.tsx\n\"use client\";\nimport { signIn } from \"@/lib/auth-client\";\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport Image from \"next/image\";\n\nexport default function LoginPage() {\n  async function handleGoogleSignIn() {\n    await signIn.social({\n      provider: \"google\",\n      callbackURL: \"/dashboard\",\n    });\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <main className=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-50 via-cyan-50 to-blue-100\">\n      <div className=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 w-full max-w-md text-center\">\n        <Image\n          src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/media-topfinanzas-com/images/topnetworks-positivo-sinfondo.webp\"\n          alt=\"TopNetworks\"\n          width={180}\n          height={40}\n          className=\"mx-auto mb-6\"\n        />\n        <h1 className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Sign in</h1>\n        <p className=\"text-gray-600 mb-8 text-sm\">\n          Access is restricted to @topnetworks.co and @topfinanzas.com accounts.\n        </p>\n        <Button\n          onClick={handleGoogleSignIn}\n          className=\"w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold py-3\"\n        >\n          Continue with Google\n        </Button>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Better Auth Database Tables\n\nBetter Auth auto-manages these tables — **never modify them manually**:\n\n| Table          | Purpose                                                   |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `user`         | User profiles (id, name, email, image, createdAt)         |\n| `session`      | Active sessions (id, userId, token, expiresAt)            |\n| `account`      | OAuth account links (userId, provider, providerAccountId) |\n| `verification` | Email verification tokens                                 |\n\nThese tables are created/migrated automatically when Better Auth initializes with a database connection.\n\n### Better Auth Migration (initial setup)\n\n```typescript\n// Run once to create Better Auth tables\nimport { auth } from \"@/lib/auth\";\nawait auth.api.migrate(); // Creates all Better Auth tables\n```\n\n---\n\n## Google Drive OAuth (Secondary — Backup Feature)\n\nRoute-genius uses a separate OAuth flow for Google Drive access, stored in HTTP-only cookies:\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/auth/google-drive/callback/route.ts\nimport { cookies } from \"next/headers\";\nimport type { NextRequest } from \"next/server\";\n\nexport async function GET(request: NextRequest) {\n  const { searchParams } = new URL(request.url);\n  const code = searchParams.get(\"code\");\n\n  if (!code) {\n    return Response.redirect(\n      `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/dashboard/settings?error=drive_auth_failed`,\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Exchange code for tokens\n  const tokenResponse = await fetch(\"https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token\", {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    body: new URLSearchParams({\n      code,\n      client_id: process.env.GOOGLE_DRIVE_CLIENT_ID!,\n      client_secret: process.env.GOOGLE_DRIVE_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n      redirect_uri: process.env.GOOGLE_DRIVE_REDIRECT_URI!,\n      grant_type: \"authorization_code\",\n    }),\n  });\n\n  const tokens = await tokenResponse.json();\n\n  // Store in HTTP-only cookie — 30 days\n  const cookieStore = await cookies();\n  cookieStore.set(\"rg_gdrive_tokens\", JSON.stringify(tokens), {\n    httpOnly: true,\n    secure: process.env.NODE_ENV === \"production\",\n    maxAge: 60 * 60 * 24 * 30,\n    path: \"/\",\n  });\n\n  return Response.redirect(\n    `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/dashboard/settings?drive=connected`,\n  );\n}\n```\n\nGoogle Drive OAuth scope: `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.file` (only files created by the app — principle of least privilege).\n\n---\n\n## Cookie Naming Convention\n\nBetter Auth uses different cookie name prefixes based on protocol:\n\n| Environment        | Cookie Name                          |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| Production (HTTPS) | `__Secure-better-auth.session_token` |\n| Development (HTTP) | `better-auth.session_token`          |\n\nAlways check for both when reading session cookies in middleware.\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables Required\n\n```bash\n# Better Auth core\nDATABASE_URL=                           # PostgreSQL connection string for session storage\nNEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=                    # Canonical app URL\nBETTER_AUTH_URL=                        # Optional — overrides NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL for auth\n\n# Google OAuth (user authentication)\nGOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=                       # Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID\nGOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=                   # Google OAuth 2.0 Client Secret\n\n# Google Drive OAuth (backup feature — separate OAuth client)\nGOOGLE_DRIVE_CLIENT_ID=\nGOOGLE_DRIVE_CLIENT_SECRET=\nGOOGLE_DRIVE_REDIRECT_URI=              # e.g. http://localhost:3070/api/auth/google-drive/callback\n```\n\n---\n\n## Access Control Patterns\n\n### Server Action Guard\n\n```typescript\n// Pattern: always first line in any Server Action\nexport async function mutateDataAction(data: InputType) {\n  const userId = await requireUserId(); // Redirects to /login if not authenticated\n\n  // All subsequent code runs only for authenticated users\n  const result = await performOperation(data, userId);\n  return { success: true, data: result };\n}\n```\n\n### Server Component Guard\n\n```typescript\n// Pattern: in Server Components where you want to conditionally render\nimport { getServerSession } from \"@/lib/auth-session\";\nimport { redirect } from \"next/navigation\";\n\nexport default async function DashboardPage() {\n  const session = await getServerSession();\n  if (!session) redirect(\"/login\");\n\n  // Render authenticated UI\n  return <Dashboard user={session.user} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Client Component Session Check\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\nimport { useSession } from \"@/lib/auth-client\";\nimport { useRouter } from \"next/navigation\";\nimport { useEffect } from \"react\";\n\nexport function ProtectedClientComponent() {\n  const { data: session, isPending } = useSession();\n  const router = useRouter();\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!isPending && !session) {\n      router.push(\"/login\");\n    }\n  }, [session, isPending, router]);\n\n  if (isPending) return <LoadingSkeleton />;\n  if (!session) return null;\n\n  return <div>Authenticated content</div>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Sign Out\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\nimport { signOut } from \"@/lib/auth-client\";\nimport { useRouter } from \"next/navigation\";\n\nexport function SignOutButton() {\n  const router = useRouter();\n\n  async function handleSignOut() {\n    await signOut({\n      fetchOptions: {\n        onSuccess: () => router.push(\"/login\"),\n      },\n    });\n  }\n\n  return <button onClick={handleSignOut}>Sign out</button>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **Never** implement custom session storage — use Better Auth''s PostgreSQL adapter\n- **Never** store sensitive tokens (OAuth tokens, session data) in `localStorage` — use HTTP-only cookies\n- **Never** manually modify Better Auth tables (`user`, `session`, `account`, `verification`)\n- **Never** skip `requireUserId()` in Server Actions that access user data\n- **Never** bypass domain restriction for convenience — `@topnetworks.co` and `@topfinanzas.com` only\n- **Never** use the same Google OAuth client ID for user authentication and Google Drive backup — these are separate OAuth credentials\n- The `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` bypasses RLS — this is intentional for server-side operations but must never be used for auth validation\n- Session cookie prefix (`__Secure-`) is auto-applied on HTTPS — do not hard-code the prefix; always check for both variants in middleware\n- Do not add `auth.uid()` to Supabase RLS policies — Better Auth does not use Supabase Auth, so `auth.uid()` will always return null\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:40:23.648Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced authentication and authorization capabilities with Google OAuth and Supabase sessions","zh":"适合需要使用Google OAuth和Supabase会话进行高级身份验证和授权的AI代理","ja":"Google OAuthおよびSupabaseセッションを使用した高度な認証および認可機能が必要なAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"Google OAuth와 Supabase 세션을 사용한 고급 인증 및 인가 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de autenticación y autorización avanzadas con Google OAuth y sesiones de Supabase","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités d''authentification et d''autorisation avancées avec Google OAuth et des sessions Supabase","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsfunktionen mit Google OAuth und Supabase-Sitzungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de capacidades avançadas de autenticação e autorização com Google OAuth e sessões Supabase","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым требуются передовые возможности аутентификации и авторизации с Google OAuth и сессиями Supabase","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للتأشير والتصريح باستخدام Google OAuth و Supabase sessions"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage login flows, session management, and protected route middleware using OAuth integration and domain-restricted access, while leveraging technologies like Google OAuth and Supabase sessions for secure authentication","zh":"赋予代理管理登录流程、会话管理和受保护路由中间件的能力，使用OAuth集成和域受限访问，同时利用Google OAuth和Supabase会话等技术实现安全身份验证","ja":"OAuth統合およびドメイン制限アクセスを使用してログインフロー、セッション管理、保護されたルートミドルウェアを管理するエージェントを可能にし、Google OAuthおよびSupabaseセッションなどの技術を利用して安全な認証を実現する","ko":"OAuth 통합 및 도메인 제한 접근을 사용하여 로그인 흐름, 세션 관리, 보호된 라우트 미들웨어를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, Google OAuth 및 Supabase 세션 등의 기술을 활용하여 안전한 인증을 구현합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar flujos de inicio de sesión, gestión de sesiones y middleware de rutas protegidas utilizando la integración de OAuth y el acceso restringido por dominio, aprovechando tecnologías como Google OAuth y sesiones de Supabase para una autenticación segura","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les flux de connexion, la gestion des sessions et le middleware de routes protégées en utilisant l''intégration OAuth et l''accès restreint par domaine, tout en exploitant des technologies comme Google OAuth et des sessions Supabase pour une authentification sécurisée","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Login-Flows, Sitzungsverwaltung und geschütztes Route-Middleware über OAuth-Integration und domainbeschränkten Zugriff zu verwalten, während sie Technologien wie Google OAuth und Supabase-Sitzungen für eine sichere Authentifizierung nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar fluxos de login, gerenciamento de sessões e middleware de rotas protegidas usando integração OAuth e acesso restrito por domínio, aproveitando tecnologias como Google OAuth e Supabase sessions para autenticação segura","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять потоками входа, управлением сессиями и middleware защищенных маршрутов с помощью интеграции OAuth и доступа, ограниченного по домену, используя технологии как Google OAuth и Supabase sessions для безопасной аутентификации","ar":"يعزز الوكلاء لإدارة تدفقات تسجيل الدخول وإدارة الجلسات وبرمجيات الوسيط للطرق المحمية باستخدام دمج OAuth والوصول المقيد بالโดمن، واستخدام تقنيات مثل Google OAuth و Supabase sessions للتأشير الآمن"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Google Drive OAuth for secondary authentication","Configuring protected route middleware for access control","Managing session management and login flows with Supabase sessions"],"zh":["为二次身份验证实现Google Drive OAuth","配置受保护路由中间件以控制访问","使用Supabase会话管理会话管理和登录流程"],"ja":["二次認証のためにGoogle Drive OAuthを実装する","アクセス制御のために保護されたルートミドルウェアを構成する","Supabaseセッションを使用してセッション管理とログインフローを管理する"],"ko":["2차 인증을 위해 Google Drive OAuth를 구현하는 것","액세스 제어를 위해 보호된 라우트 미들웨어를 구성하는 것","Supabase 세션을 사용하여 세션 관리 및 로그인 흐름을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Implementar Google Drive OAuth para la autenticación secundaria","Configurar middleware de rutas protegidas para el control de acceso","Gestionar flujos de inicio de sesión y gestión de sesiones con sesiones de Supabase"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre Google Drive OAuth pour l''authentification secondaire","Configurer le middleware de routes protégées pour le contrôle d''accès","Gérer les flux de connexion et la gestion des sessions avec des sessions Supabase"],"de":["Implementierung von Google Drive OAuth für die sekundäre Authentifizierung","Konfigurieren von geschütztem Route-Middleware für den Zugriffscontrol","Verwalten von Login-Flows und Sitzungsverwaltung mit Supabase-Sitzungen"],"pt":["Implementar Google Drive OAuth para autenticação secundária","Configurar middleware de rotas protegidas para controle de acesso","Gerenciar gerenciamento de sessões e fluxos de login com Supabase sessions"],"ru":["Реализация Google Drive OAuth для вторичной аутентификации","Настройка middleware защищенных маршрутов для контроля доступа","Управление управлением сессиями и потоками входа с Supabase sessions"],"ar":["تنفيذ Google Drive OAuth للتحقق الثانوي","تكوين برمجيات الوسيط للطرق المحمية للتحكم في الوصول","إدارة إدارة الجلسات وتدفقات تسجيل الدخول مع Supabase sessions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not suitable for database RLS configuration","Requires Google OAuth and Supabase sessions setup"],"zh":["不适合数据库RLS配置","需要Google OAuth和Supabase会话设置"],"ja":["データベースRLS構成には適していない","Google OAuthおよびSupabaseセッションの設定が必要"],"ko":["데이터베이스 RLS 구성에 적합하지 않음","Google OAuth 및 Supabase 세션 설정이 필요"],"es":["No es adecuado para la configuración de RLS de base de datos","Requiere la configuración de Google OAuth y sesiones de Supabase"],"fr":["N''est pas adapté pour la configuration RLS de base de données","Nécessite la configuration de Google OAuth et des sessions Supabase"],"de":["Nicht geeignet für die Konfiguration der Datenbank-RLS","Benötigt die Einrichtung von Google OAuth und Supabase-Sitzungen"],"pt":["Não é adequado para configuração de RLS de banco de dados","Requer configuração de Google OAuth e Supabase sessions"],"ru":["Не подходит для настройки RLS базы данных","Требует настройки Google OAuth и Supabase sessions"],"ar":["غير مناسب لتكوين قاعدة بيانات RLS","يتطلب إعداد Google OAuth و Supabase sessions"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8e9d658fc3784918984b14c5822c501790d7abf7fcbef923034d1bda1abba8b9","qualityScore":60}');
