 모델의 가용성을 연구하기 위한 툴입니다","es":"openrouter-research es una herramienta de investigación para desarrolladores que utiliza la API de OpenRouter y el modelo Grok","fr":"openrouter-research est un outil de recherche pour les développeurs qui utilise l''API OpenRouter et le modèle Grok","de":"openrouter-research ist ein Forschungstool für Entwickler, das die OpenRouter-API und das Grok-Modell verwendet","pt":"OpenRouter Research é uma ferramenta de pesquisa para especificações da API OpenRouter","ru":"OpenRouter Research - это инструмент для изучения спецификаций API OpenRouter","ar":"OpenRouter Research هو أداة بحث لمواصفات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات OpenRouter"},"features":{"en":["Researches OpenRouter API specifications for SFUMATO","Analyzes Grok model availability through app/tools/openrouter_tool.py","Utilizes ENV vars: OPENROUTER_API_KEY and OPENROUTER_BASE_URL","Employs httpx.A client for API interactions","Supports text-only input through prompt_service.generate_prompt() and prompt_service.revise_prompt()","Enables Grok with vision through judge_service.evaluate() for image analysis"],"zh":["支持 OpenRouter API 和 Grok 模型","使用 httpx.A 作为客户端","ENV vars: OPENROUTER_API_KEY 和 OPENROUTER_BASE_URL","支持 text-only 输入和 vision 分析","使用 app/tools/openrouter_tool.py 进行研究"],"ja":["OpenRouter API と Grok モデルをサポート","httpx.A をクライアントとして使用","ENV vars: OPENROUTER_API_KEY と OPENROUTER_BASE_URL","テキストのみ入力とビジョン分析をサポート","app/tools/openrouter_tool.py を使用して研究を実施"],"ko":["OpenRouter API 및 Grok 모델을 지원","httpx.A를 클라이언트로 사용","ENV vars: OPENROUTER_API_KEY 및 OPENROUTER_BASE_URL","텍스트 전용 입력 및 비전 분석을 지원","app/tools/openrouter_tool.py를 사용하여 연구를 수행"],"es":["Investiga las especificaciones de la API de OpenRouter","Verifica la disponibilidad del modelo Grok para SFUMATO","Utiliza el cliente httpx para realizar solicitudes a la API","Soporta variables de entorno como OPENROUTER_API_KEY","Permite la revisión de promtps con Grok y texto solo","Analiza imágenes generadas con Grok y visión"],"fr":["Recherche les spécifications de l''API OpenRouter","Vérifie la disponibilité du modèle Grok pour SFUMATO","Utilise le client httpx pour effectuer des requêtes à l''API","Prend en charge les variables d''environnement comme OPENROUTER_API_KEY","Permet la révision de promtps avec Grok et texte seul","Analyse les images générées avec Grok et vision"],"de":["Untersucht die Spezifikationen der OpenRouter-API","Überprüft die Verfügbarkeit des Grok-Modells für SFUMATO","Verwendet den httpx-Client, um Anfragen an die API zu stellen","Unterstützt Umgebungsvariablen wie OPENROUTER_API_KEY","Ermöglicht die Überprüfung von Prompts mit Grok und Text nur","Analysiert generierte Bilder mit Grok und Vision"],"pt":["Integração com a API OpenRouter","Suporte ao modelo Grok para SFUMATO","Utilização de variáveis de ambiente como OPENROUTER_API_KEY","Comunicação com o cliente via httpx.A","Análise de imagens geradas com Grok com visão","Compatibilidade com SFUMATO"],"ru":["Интеграция с API OpenRouter","Поддержка модели Grok для SFUMATO","Использование переменных окружения как OPENROUTER_API_KEY","Общение с клиентом через httpx.A","Анализ сгенерированных изображений с Grok с видением","Совместимость с SFUMATO и ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات OpenRouter","دعم نموذج Grok لمنصة SFUMATO","استخدام متغيرات البيئة مثل OPENROUTER_API_KEY","التفاعل مع العميل عبر httpx.A","تحليل الصور المولدة مع Grok بالرؤية","التوافق مع منصة SFUMATO وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use openrouter-research","openrouter-research setup guide","openrouter-research alternative","openrouter-research vs api.ai","openrouter-research install","what is openrouter-research","openrouter-research api specifications","openrouter-research grok model availability"],"zh":["OpenRouter Research","AI 研究工具","OpenRouter API","Grok 模型","httpx.A","ENV vars","文本分析","视觉分析"],"ja":["OpenRouter Research","AI エージェント","OpenRouter API","Grok モデル","httpx.A","ENV vars","テキスト分析","ビジョン分析"],"ko":["OpenRouter Research","AI 도구","OpenRouter API","Grok 모델","httpx.A","ENV vars","텍스트 분석","비전 분석"],"es":["openrouter-research","API de OpenRouter","modelo Grok","SFUMATO","desarrollo de AI","herramientas de investigación de AI","configuración de openrouter-research","Guía de openrouter-research","openrouter-research para desarrolladores"],"fr":["openrouter-research","API OpenRouter","modèle Grok","SFUMATO","développement d''IA","outils de recherche d''IA","configuration de openrouter-research","Guide de openrouter-research","openrouter-research pour les développeurs"],"de":["openrouter-research","OpenRouter-API","Grok-Modell","SFUMATO","AI-Entwicklung","AI-Forschungstools","Konfiguration von openrouter-research","Leitfaden für openrouter-research","openrouter-research für Entwickler"],"pt":["OpenRouter Research","API OpenRouter","Modelo Grok","SFUMATO","Desenvolvimento de IA","Ferramentas de pesquisa de API","Integração de API","Variáveis de ambiente","httpx.A","Análise de imagens"],"ru":["OpenRouter Research","API OpenRouter","Модель Grok","SFUMATO","Разработка ИИ","Инструменты для изучения API","Интеграция API","Переменные окружения","httpx.A","Анализ изображений","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["OpenRouter Research","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات OpenRouter","نموذج Grok","منصة SFUMATO","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات بحث واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","متغيرات البيئة","httpx.A","تحليل الصور","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"NikGor","repo":"image-prompt-optimizer","repoPath":"NikGor/image-prompt-optimizer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T18:39:05Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openrouter-research","description":"Research OpenRouter API docs, available Grok model IDs, vision capability for the judge service, and integration patterns. Use when implementing openrouter_tool.py, when checking which Grok model supports vision/image input for judge_service.py, when OpenRouter returns unexpected errors, or when verifying model availability and context limits.","bodyPreview":"# OpenRouter Research\n\nResearch current OpenRouter API specifications and Grok model availability for SFUMATO.\n\n## Context\n\nAll text LLM calls in SFUMATO go through `app/tools/openrouter_tool.py`:\n- `prompt_service.generate_prompt()` — Grok, text-only input\n- `prompt_service.revise_prompt()` — Grok, text-only input\n- `judge_service.evaluate()` — **Grok with vision** (must analyze generated image)\n\nENV vars: `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`, `OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1`\nClient: `httpx.A","body":"# OpenRouter Research\n\nResearch current OpenRouter API specifications and Grok model availability for SFUMATO.\n\n## Context\n\nAll text LLM calls in SFUMATO go through `app/tools/openrouter_tool.py`:\n- `prompt_service.generate_prompt()` — Grok, text-only input\n- `prompt_service.revise_prompt()` — Grok, text-only input\n- `judge_service.evaluate()` — **Grok with vision** (must analyze generated image)\n\nENV vars: `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`, `OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1`\nClient: `httpx.AsyncClient` — OpenAI-compatible API\n\nRead existing file first if it exists:\n- `app/tools/openrouter_tool.py`\n- `config.py`\n\n## Step 1: OpenRouter API Fundamentals\n\n1. Fetch: `https://openrouter.ai/docs/api-reference/overview`\n2. Fetch: `https://openrouter.ai/docs/requests`\n3. Search: `OpenRouter API python httpx async chat completions 2025`\n\nCapture:\n- Base URL: `https://openrouter.ai/api/v1`\n- Auth header format (`Authorization: Bearer` vs `API-Key`)\n- Required request headers: `HTTP-Referer`, `X-Title`\n- Chat completions endpoint: `POST /v1/chat/completions`\n- Request body schema: `model`, `messages`, `temperature`, `max_tokens`, `stream`\n- Response schema: `choices[0].message.content`\n- Error response format and status codes (429, 402, 503, 500)\n\n## Step 2: Available Grok Models\n\n1. Fetch: `https://openrouter.ai/models?q=grok`\n2. Search: `OpenRouter xAI Grok models list 2025`\n3. Fetch: `https://openrouter.ai/x-ai` if available\n\nFor each available Grok model, capture:\n- Full model ID string (e.g. `x-ai/grok-beta`, `x-ai/grok-vision-beta`)\n- Context window size (tokens)\n- **Supports image input (vision)?** — critical for judge_service\n- Cost per 1M input/output tokens\n\nDetermine the best model for each use case:\n- `prompt_gen`: text-only, large context\n- `prompt_revise`: text-only\n- `judge`: **MUST support vision/image input**\n\n## Step 3: Image Input Format for Vision Models\n\nSince `judge_service.py` sends a generated image to Grok for evaluation:\n\n1. Search: `OpenRouter vision model image input base64 format 2025`\n2. Fetch: `https://openrouter.ai/docs/features/vision`\n3. Search: `OpenAI-compatible vision API image_url content type format`\n\nCapture:\n- Message content format for image:\n  ```json\n  {\"type\": \"image_url\", \"image_url\": {\"url\": \"data:image/jpeg;base64,...\"}}\n  ```\n  vs URL-based image reference\n- Max image size limits\n- Supported formats (JPEG, PNG, WebP)\n- Whether OpenRouter passes base64 to xAI directly or requires URL\n\n## Step 4: Error Handling and Retry Strategy\n\n1. Search: `OpenRouter API error handling retry 429 503 2025`\n2. Fetch: `https://openrouter.ai/docs/api-reference/errors` if available\n\nCapture:\n- 429 rate limit: `retry-after` header? fixed backoff interval?\n- 402 payment/balance: raise immediately, no retry\n- 503 model unavailable: retry with backoff\n- Recommended timeout values for text calls vs vision calls\n- Max retries pattern\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Section 1: openrouter_tool.py Implementation Blueprint\n\n```python\n# Async httpx client structure\nBASE_URL = \"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\"\n\n# Required headers\nheaders = {\n    \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {api_key}\",\n    \"HTTP-Referer\": \"...\",\n    \"X-Title\": \"SFUMATO\",\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n}\n\n# chat_completion(model, messages, temperature, max_tokens) -> str\n# vision_completion(model, text_messages_plus_image_message) -> str\n# Retry pattern for 429/503 (show how many retries, backoff)\n# Error handling: which codes to retry vs raise immediately\n```\n\n### Section 2: Model Selection Table\n\n| Use Case | Recommended Model ID | Context | Vision | Notes |\n|----------|---------------------|---------|--------|-------|\n| prompt_gen | x-ai/grok-... | N | No | |\n| prompt_revise | x-ai/grok-... | N | No | |\n| judge | x-ai/grok-... | N | **YES** | Required |\n\n### Section 3: Image Message Format\n\nExact Python dict structure to use when sending image to judge:\n```python\n{\n    \"role\": \"user\",\n    \"content\": [\n        {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"...judge prompt...\"},\n        {\"type\": \"image_url\", \"image_url\": {\"url\": \"data:image/jpeg;base64,...\"}}\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n### Section 4: Recommended Constants for config.py\n\n```python\nOPENROUTER_BASE_URL = \"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\"\nOPENROUTER_MODEL_PROMPT_GEN = \"x-ai/grok-...\"\nOPENROUTER_MODEL_PROMPT_REVISE = \"x-ai/grok-...\"\nOPENROUTER_MODEL_JUDGE = \"x-ai/grok-vision-...\"  # must support vision\nOPENROUTER_TIMEOUT_TEXT = 30\nOPENROUTER_TIMEOUT_VISION = 45\nOPENROUTER_MAX_RETRIES = 2\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Never log API key, response.text for large vision calls, or base64 image data\n- Image for judge: read from `data/sessions/<id>/iter_<n>.jpg`, encode as base64\n- The judge call is the only one that uses vision; wrap it separately in `vision_completion()`\n- `HTTP-Referer` should be `\"http://localhost:5000\"` for local dev\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:43:04.503Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced OpenRouter API analysis and Grok model integration for SFUMATO text LLM calls.","zh":"适用于需要高级 OpenRouter API 分析和 Grok 模型集成以进行 SFUMATO 文本 LLM 调用的 AI Agents。","ja":"OpenRouter API 分析と Grok モデルの統合が必要な SFUMATO テキスト LLM 呼び出しを実行する AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 OpenRouter API 분석 및 Grok 모델 통합이 필요한 SFUMATO 텍스트 LLM 호출을 사용하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan un análisis avanzado de la API de OpenRouter y la integración del modelo Grok para llamadas de LLM de texto SFUMATO.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une analyse avancée de l''API OpenRouter et l''intégration du modèle Grok pour les appels de LLM de texte SFUMATO.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Analyse der OpenRouter-API und die Integration des Grok-Modells für SFUMATO-Text-LLM-Aufrufe benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de análise avançada da OpenRouter API e integração do modelo Grok para chamadas de LLM de texto SFUMATO.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется расширенный анализ OpenRouter API и интеграция модели Grok для вызовов текстового LLM SFUMATO.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الإصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم لــ OpenRouter API ودمج نموذج Grok لاستدعاءات LLM النصية SFUMATO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze OpenRouter API specifications and Grok model availability using httpx client and ENV vars like OPENROUTER_API_KEY, unlocking seamless text LLM calls through app/tools/openrouter_tool.py.","zh":"使得代理能够分析 OpenRouter API 规范和 Grok 模型的可用性，使用 httpx 客户端和环境变量，如 OPENROUTER_API_KEY，通过 app/tools/openrouter_tool.py 解锁无缝的文本 LLM 调用。","ja":"エージェントが OpenRouter API の仕様と Grok モデルの可用性を分析できるようにし、httpx クライアントと環境変数 (OPENROUTER_API_KEY など) を使用して、app/tools/openrouter_tool.py 経由でシームレスにテキスト LLM 呼び出しを実行できます。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenRouter API 사양 및 Grok 모델 가용성을 분석할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 httpx 클라이언트 및 환경 변수(예: OPENROUTER_API_KEY)를 사용하여 app/tools/openrouter_tool.py를 통해 무결점으로 텍스트 LLM 호출을 실행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar las especificaciones de la API de OpenRouter y la disponibilidad del modelo Grok mediante el cliente httpx y variables de entorno como OPENROUTER_API_KEY, lo que permite llamadas de LLM de texto sin problemas a través de app/tools/openrouter_tool.py.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les spécifications de l''API OpenRouter et la disponibilité du modèle Grok à l''aide du client httpx et des variables d''environnement comme OPENROUTER_API_KEY, déverrouillant ainsi des appels de LLM de texte sans interruption via app/tools/openrouter_tool.py.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Spezifikationen der OpenRouter-API und die Verfügbarkeit des Grok-Modells mithilfe des httpx-Clients und Umgebungsvariablen wie OPENROUTER_API_KEY zu analysieren, was eine nahtlose Text-LLM-Aufrufe über app/tools/openrouter_tool.py ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar especificações da OpenRouter API e disponibilidade do modelo Grok usando o cliente httpx e variáveis de ambiente como OPENROUTER_API_KEY, desbloqueando chamadas de LLM de texto sem problemas por meio de app/tools/openrouter_tool.py.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать спецификации OpenRouter API и доступность модели Grok с помощью клиента httpx и переменных окружения, таких как OPENROUTER_API_KEY, открывая безпроблемные вызовы текстового LLM через app/tools/openrouter_tool.py.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تحليل مواصفات OpenRouter API ومتوفرة نموذج Grok باستخدام عميل httpx ومتغيرات البيئة مثل OPENROUTER_API_KEY، وفك القفل لاستدعاءات LLM النصية دون مشاكل من خلال app/tools/openrouter_tool.py."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing OpenRouter API specifications for SFUMATO compatibility","Validating Grok model availability for text-only input and vision-based services","Debugging OpenRouter API integrations using ENV vars and httpx client"],"zh":["分析 OpenRouter API 规范以进行 SFUMATO 兼容性检查","验证 Grok 模型的可用性用于文本输入和基于视觉的服务","使用环境变量和 httpx 客户端调试 OpenRouter API 集成"],"ja":["SFUMATO との互換性を確認するために OpenRouter API の仕様を分析する","テキスト入力とビジョンベースのサービス用の Grok モデルの可用性を検証する","環境変数と httpx クライアントを使用して OpenRouter API の統合をデバッグする"],"ko":["SFUMATO 호환성을 확인하기 위해 OpenRouter API 사양을 분석함","텍스트 입력 및 비전 기반 서비스를 위한 Grok 모델의 가용성을 확인함","환경 변수 및 httpx 클라이언트를 사용하여 OpenRouter API 통합을 디버깅함"],"es":["Análisis de las especificaciones de la API de OpenRouter para la compatibilidad con SFUMATO","Validación de la disponibilidad del modelo Grok para entrada de texto y servicios basados en visión","Depuración de las integraciones de la API de OpenRouter mediante variables de entorno y cliente httpx"],"fr":["Analyse des spécifications de l''API OpenRouter pour la compatibilité avec SFUMATO","Validation de la disponibilité du modèle Grok pour l''entrée de texte et les services basés sur la vision","Débogage des intégrations de l''API OpenRouter à l''aide de variables d''environnement et de client httpx"],"de":["Analyse der Spezifikationen der OpenRouter-API für die Kompatibilität mit SFUMATO","Überprüfung der Verfügbarkeit des Grok-Modells für Texteingabe und visionbasierte Dienste","Fehlerbehebung bei der Integration der OpenRouter-API mithilfe von Umgebungsvariablen und httpx-Client"],"pt":["Analisar especificações da OpenRouter API para compatibilidade com SFUMATO","Validar a disponibilidade do modelo Grok para entrada de texto apenas e serviços baseados em visão","Depurar integrações da OpenRouter API usando variáveis de ambiente e cliente httpx"],"ru":["Анализировать спецификации OpenRouter API для совместимости с SFUMATO","Проверять доступность модели Grok для ввода текста и сервисов на основе зрения","Отлаживать интеграции OpenRouter API с помощью переменных окружения и клиента httpx"],"ar":["تحليل مواصفات OpenRouter API لتوافق SFUMATO","التحقق من توافر نموذج Grok للإدخال النصي فقط والخدمات القائمة على الرؤية","تصحيح أخطاء تكامل OpenRouter API باستخدام متغيرات البيئة وعميل httpx"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenRouter API Key and Base URL","Python 3.x compatibility required for httpx client","Limited to SFUMATO text LLM calls through app/tools/openrouter_tool.py"],"zh":["需要 OpenRouter API 密钥和基本 URL","需要 Python 3.x 兼容性以支持 httpx 客户端","仅限通过 app/tools/openrouter_tool.py 进行 SFUMATO 文本 LLM 调用"],"ja":["OpenRouter API キーとベース URL が必要","httpx クライアントをサポートするために Python 3.x との互換性が必要","app/tools/openrouter_tool.py 経由での SFUMATO テキスト LLM 呼び出しのみに限定される"],"ko":["OpenRouter API 키 및 기본 URL이 필요함","httpx 클라이언트를 지원하기 위해 Python 3.x와의 호환성이 필요함","app/tools/openrouter_tool.py를 통해 SFUMATO 텍스트 LLM 호출만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere clave de API de OpenRouter y URL base","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x para el cliente httpx","Limitado a llamadas de LLM de texto SFUMATO a través de app/tools/openrouter_tool.py"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API OpenRouter et une URL de base","La compatibilité avec Python 3.x est requise pour le client httpx","Limité aux appels de LLM de texte SFUMATO via app/tools/openrouter_tool.py"],"de":["Benötigt OpenRouter-API-Schlüssel und Basis-URL","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität ist für den httpx-Client erforderlich","Begrenzt auf SFUMATO-Text-LLM-Aufrufe über app/tools/openrouter_tool.py"],"pt":["Requer chave da OpenRouter API e URL Base","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária para o cliente httpx","Limitado a chamadas de LLM de texto SFUMATO por meio de app/tools/openrouter_tool.py"],"ru":["Требуется ключ OpenRouter API и базовый URL","Требуется совместимость с Python 3.x для клиента httpx","Ограничен вызовами текстового LLM SFUMATO через app/tools/openrouter_tool.py"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح OpenRouter API و URL الأساسي","متوافق مع Python 3.x مطلوب للعميل httpx","محدود لاستدعاءات LLM النصية SFUMATO من خلال app/tools/openrouter_tool.py"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"bf4c05c7f57402aafad31fe5e1b5fbed139f6f58114fdbbe9c67725f76ec816f","qualityScore":60}');
