]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Bats (Bash Automated Testing System) installation","Limited to testing shell scripts","Dependent on shell environment for testing"],"zh":["需要安装Bats（Bash Automated Testing System）","仅限于测试shell脚本","依赖于shell环境进行测试"],"ja":["Bats（Bash Automated Testing System）のインストールが必要","シェルスクリプトのテストに限定される","テストにはシェル環境に依存する"],"ko":["Bats（Bash Automated Testing System）설치 필요","쉘 스크립트 테스트에만 국한됨","테스트에는 쉘 환경에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Bats (Sistema de pruebas automatizadas de Bash)","Limitado a la prueba de scripts de shell","Dependiente del entorno de shell para las pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Bats (Système de tests automatisés Bash)","Limité aux tests de scripts shell","Dépendant de l''environnement shell pour les tests"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Bats (Bash-Automatisiertes Testsystem)","Begrenzt auf das Testen von Shell-Skripten","Abhängig von der Shell-Umgebung für das Testen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Bats (Bash Automated Testing System)","Limitado ao teste de scripts de shell","Dependente do ambiente de shell para teste"],"ru":["Требует установки Bats (Bash Automated Testing System)","Ограничен тестированием скриптов shell","Зависит от среды shell для тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Bats (نظام اختبار آلي Bash)","محدود باختبار البرامج النصية للshell","يعتمد على بيئة shell للاختبار"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"bbf2ab75641bf998873c2a25e408a7a800a8e727d876ce1c56b20b889772ac78","qualityScore":60}');
