t (TDD) for scripts Setting up automated testing in CI/CD pipelines Testing edge cases and error conditions Validating behavior across different shell environments bats-testing-patterns is a skill that offers comprehensive guidance for writing unit tests for shell scripts using Bats, including test patterns, fixtures, and best practices.');
