INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('NehaTanti-afk/Neha-Notes/figma-analyze', 'figma-analyze', 'NehaTanti-afk', 'Neha-Notes', 'community', 'figma-analyze NehaTanti-afk Neha-Notes community The figma-analyze skill analyzes Figma components against Nexus conventions, validating design-code parity, token usage, and AI readability. It benefits developers and designers by providing a focused issues list with fixes. Figma Analyze 是一个检查 Figma 设计与代码一致性的工具，确保设计代码的正确性和可读性 Figma Analyze は、Figma デザインとコードの整合性をチェックするツールで、設計コードの正しさと可読性を確保します 피그마 분석 도구는 피그마 디자인과 코드의 일관성을 확인하는 도구로 디자인 코드의 정확성과 가독성을 보장합니다 Figma Analyze es una herramienta que valida la paridad entre diseño y código, y ofrece un informe detallado de problemas y soluciones. Figma Analyze est un outil qui valide la parité entre conception et code, et fournit un rapport détaillé des problèmes et des solutions. Figma Analyze ist ein Tool, das die Übereinstimmung zwischen Design und Code überprüft und einen detaillierten Bericht über Probleme und Lösungen bietet. O Figma Analyze é uma ferramenta que analisa componentes do Figma contra convenções do Nexus, validando a paridade de design e código Figma Analyze - это инструмент, который анализирует компоненты Figma против конвенций Nexus, проверяя соответствие дизайна и кода Figma Analyze هو أداة تحليل مكونات Figma ضد التطبيقات المتوافقة مع Nexus، والتحقق من توافق التصميم والكود how to use figma-analyze figma-analyze setup guide figma component analysis design-code parity validation figma-analyze alternative figma-analyze vs design system tools figma-analyze install nexus conventions for figma ai readability in figma designs Figma 设计分析 代码设计一致性检查 AI 设计工具 Nexus 约定 令牌使用情况检查 AI 可读性检查 Validates design-code parity against Nexus conventions Checks token usage in Figma components Analyzes AI readability of Figma designs Outputs a focused issues list with fixes Supports input via Figma URL with node-id parameter Generates reports on design-code inconsistencies figma-analyze is a skill that analyzes existing Figma components against Nexus conventions, validating design-code parity, token usage, and AI readability.');
