les-list es una herramienta de AI que lista y audita tablas expuestas en Supabase","fr":"Supabase-audit-tables-list est un outil d''IA qui répertorie et audite les tables exposées dans Supabase","de":"Supabase-audit-tables-list ist ein KI-Tool, das exponierte Tabellen in Supabase auflistet und auditiert","pt":"O supabase-audit-tables-list é uma ferramenta de auditoria que lista tabelas expostas","ru":"ИИ Агенты supabase-audit-tables-list - это инструмент аудита, который списывает открытые таблицы","ar":"supabase-audit-tables-list هو أداة تدقيق لتسجيل الجداول المعروضة"},"features":{"en":["Writes to .sb-pentest-context.json immediately after each discovery","Logs to .sb-pentest-audit.log before and after each action","Requires progressive file updates to ensure data integrity","Supports secure auditing by logging all actions and discoveries","Ensures data persistence in case of skill crashes or interruptions"],"zh":["实时更新 `.sb-pentest-context.json` 文件","在每个操作前后记录 `.sb-pentest-audit.log` 文件","确保技能在中断或崩溃时保留所有发现结果","进行实时文件更新和日志记录","支持 Supabase 表的审计和记录"],"ja":["`.sb-pentest-context.json` ファイルをリアルタイムに更新","各操作の前後に `.sb-pentest-audit.log` ファイルを記録","スキルが中断またはクラッシュした場合にすべての発見結果を保持","進行的なファイル更新とログ記録を実行","Supabase テーブルの監査と記録をサポート"],"ko":["`.sb-pentest-context.json` 파일을 실시간으로 업데이트","각 작업 전후에 `.sb-pentest-audit.log` 파일을 기록","스킬이 중단되거나 충돌할 경우 모든 발견 결과를 유지","진행적인 파일 업데이트와 로깅을 수행","Supabase 테이블의 감사와 기록을 지원"],"es":["Escribe en archivos de contexto como .sb-pentest-context.json de manera progresiva","Registra eventos en .sb-pentest-audit.log antes y después de cada acción","Soporte para auditorías de seguridad en Supabase","Capacidad para detectar tablas expuestas","Mejora de la seguridad de los datos mediante la auditoría","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como CLI"],"fr":["Écriture dans les fichiers de contexte tels que .sb-pentest-context.json de manière progressive","Enregistrement des événements dans .sb-pentest-audit.log avant et après chaque action","Prise en charge des audits de sécurité dans Supabase","Capacité à détecter les tables exposées","Amélioration de la sécurité des données via l''audit","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que CLI"],"de":["Schreiben in Kontextdateien wie .sb-pentest-context.json schrittweise","Protokollierung von Ereignissen in .sb-pentest-audit.log vor und nach jeder Aktion","Unterstützung für Sicherheitsaudits in Supabase","Fähigkeit, exponierte Tabellen zu erkennen","Verbesserung der Datensicherheit durch Audits","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie CLI"],"pt":["Escrita imediata em arquivos de contexto","Registro em logs antes e após cada ação","Atualizações progressivas de arquivos para garantir a segurança dos dados","Compatibilidade com CLI para automação de tarefas","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo de saída"],"ru":["Немедленная запись в контекстные файлы","Ведение журналов до и после каждого действия","Прогрессивные обновления файлов для обеспечения безопасности данных","Совместимость с CLI для автоматизации задач","Поддержка нескольких форматов выходных файлов"],"ar":["كتابة فورية في ملفات السياق","تسجيل السجلات قبل وأثناء كل عمل","تحديثات متتالية للملفات لضمان أمان البيانات","توافق مع CLI لتحسين أداء المهام","دعم صيغ متعددة لملفات الإخراج"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use supabase-audit-tables-list","supabase-audit-tables-list setup guide","supabase-audit-tables-list alternative","supabase-audit-tables-list vs other auditing tools","supabase-audit-tables-list install","what is supabase-audit-tables-list","supabase-audit-tables-list for AI agents","supabase-audit-tables-list for secure auditing"],"zh":["Supabase 审计表列表","实时文件更新","日志记录","Supabase 表审计","进程文件更新","AI 工具","AI 代理"],"ja":["Supabase オーディットテーブルリスト","リアルタイムファイル更新","ログ記録","Supabase テーブルの監査","進行的なファイル更新","AI エージェント","AI ツール"],"ko":["Supabase 감사 테이블 목록","실시간 파일 업데이트","로깅","Supabase 테이블 감사","진행적인 파일 업데이트","AI 에이전트","AI 도구"],"es":["supabase-audit-tables-list","agentes de AI para seguridad","herramientas de auditoría de Supabase","seguridad de datos","auditorías de seguridad","CLI","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","seguridad en la nube"],"fr":["supabase-audit-tables-list","agents d''IA pour la sécurité","outils d''audit de Supabase","sécurité des données","audits de sécurité","CLI","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","sécurité dans le cloud"],"de":["supabase-audit-tables-list","KI-Agents für Sicherheit","Supabase-Audit-Tools","Datensicherheit","Sicherheitsaudits","CLI","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Sicherheit in der Cloud"],"pt":["supabase-audit-tables-list","ferramenta de auditoria","segurança de dados","atualizações progressivas","CLI","automatização de tarefas","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты supabase-audit-tables-list","инструмент аудита","безопасность данных","прогрессивные обновления","CLI","автоматизация задач","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["supabase-audit-tables-list","أداة التدقيق","أمان البيانات","تحديثات متتالية","CLI","تحسين أداء المهام","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"marvinbiss","repo":"servicesartisans","repoPath":"marvinbiss/servicesartisans","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:56:32Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"supabase-audit-tables-list","description":"List all tables exposed via the Supabase PostgREST API to identify the attack surface.","bodyPreview":"# List Exposed Tables\n\n> 🔴 **CRITICAL: PROGRESSIVE FILE UPDATES REQUIRED**\n>\n> You MUST write to context files **AS YOU GO**, not just at the end.\n> - Write to `.sb-pentest-context.json` **IMMEDIATELY after each discovery**\n> - Log to `.sb-pentest-audit.log` **BEFORE and AFTER each action**\n> - **DO NOT** wait until the skill completes to update files\n> - If the skill crashes or is interrupted, all prior findings must already be saved\n>\n> **This is not optional. Failure to write progressively i","body":"# List Exposed Tables\n\n> 🔴 **CRITICAL: PROGRESSIVE FILE UPDATES REQUIRED**\n>\n> You MUST write to context files **AS YOU GO**, not just at the end.\n> - Write to `.sb-pentest-context.json` **IMMEDIATELY after each discovery**\n> - Log to `.sb-pentest-audit.log` **BEFORE and AFTER each action**\n> - **DO NOT** wait until the skill completes to update files\n> - If the skill crashes or is interrupted, all prior findings must already be saved\n>\n> **This is not optional. Failure to write progressively is a critical error.**\n\nThis skill discovers all database tables exposed through the Supabase PostgREST API.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- To understand the API attack surface\n- Before testing RLS policies\n- To inventory exposed data models\n- As part of a comprehensive security audit\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Supabase URL extracted (auto-invokes if needed)\n- Anon key extracted (auto-invokes if needed)\n\n## How It Works\n\nSupabase exposes tables via PostgREST at:\n```\nhttps://[project-ref].supabase.co/rest/v1/\n```\n\nThe skill uses the OpenAPI schema endpoint to enumerate tables:\n```\nhttps://[project-ref].supabase.co/rest/v1/?apikey=[anon-key]\n```\n\n## What Gets Exposed\n\nBy default, Supabase exposes tables in the `public` schema. Tables are exposed when:\n\n1. They exist in an exposed schema (default: `public`)\n2. No explicit `REVOKE` has been done\n3. PostgREST can see them\n\n## Usage\n\n### Basic Table List\n\n```\nList tables exposed on my Supabase project\n```\n\n### With Schema Information\n\n```\nList all exposed tables with column details\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n EXPOSED TABLES\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n Project: abc123def.supabase.co\n Schema: public\n Tables Found: 8\n\n ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n Table Inventory\n ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n 1. users\n    ├── Columns: id, email, name, avatar_url, created_at\n    ├── Primary Key: id (uuid)\n    ├── RLS Status: Unknown (test with supabase-audit-rls)\n    └── Risk: ⚠️ Contains user PII\n\n 2. profiles\n    ├── Columns: id, user_id, bio, website, social_links\n    ├── Primary Key: id (uuid)\n    ├── Foreign Key: user_id → auth.users\n    └── Risk: ⚠️ Contains user PII\n\n 3. posts\n    ├── Columns: id, author_id, title, content, published, created_at\n    ├── Primary Key: id (uuid)\n    └── Risk: ℹ️ Content data\n\n 4. comments\n    ├── Columns: id, post_id, user_id, content, created_at\n    ├── Primary Key: id (uuid)\n    └── Risk: ℹ️ Content data\n\n 5. orders\n    ├── Columns: id, user_id, total, status, items, created_at\n    ├── Primary Key: id (uuid)\n    └── Risk: 🔴 Contains financial/transaction data\n\n 6. products\n    ├── Columns: id, name, description, price, stock, image_url\n    ├── Primary Key: id (uuid)\n    └── Risk: ℹ️ Public catalog data\n\n 7. settings\n    ├── Columns: id, key, value, updated_at\n    ├── Primary Key: id (uuid)\n    └── Risk: ⚠️ May contain sensitive configuration\n\n 8. api_keys\n    ├── Columns: id, user_id, key_hash, name, last_used\n    ├── Primary Key: id (uuid)\n    └── Risk: 🔴 Contains secrets\n\n ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n Summary\n ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n Total Tables: 8\n High Risk: 2 (orders, api_keys)\n Medium Risk: 3 (users, profiles, settings)\n Low Risk: 3 (posts, comments, products)\n\n Next Steps:\n ├── Run supabase-audit-tables-read to test actual data access\n ├── Run supabase-audit-rls to verify RLS policies\n └── Review high-risk tables first\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n```\n\n## Risk Classification\n\nTables are classified by likely content:\n\n| Risk | Table Patterns | Examples |\n|------|---------------|----------|\n| 🔴 High | Financial, secrets, auth | orders, payments, api_keys, secrets |\n| ⚠️ Medium | User PII, config | users, profiles, settings, preferences |\n| ℹ️ Low | Public content | posts, products, categories, tags |\n\n## Context Output\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tables\": {\n    \"count\": 8,\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"users\",\n        \"schema\": \"public\",\n        \"columns\": [\"id\", \"email\", \"name\", \"avatar_url\", \"created_at\"],\n        \"primary_key\": \"id\",\n        \"risk_level\": \"medium\",\n        \"risk_reason\": \"Contains user PII\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"orders\",\n        \"schema\": \"public\",\n        \"columns\": [\"id\", \"user_id\", \"total\", \"status\", \"items\", \"created_at\"],\n        \"primary_key\": \"id\",\n        \"risk_level\": \"high\",\n        \"risk_reason\": \"Contains financial data\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"by_risk\": {\n      \"high\": [\"orders\", \"api_keys\"],\n      \"medium\": [\"users\", \"profiles\", \"settings\"],\n      \"low\": [\"posts\", \"comments\", \"products\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Hidden Tables\n\nSome tables may not appear in the OpenAPI schema:\n\n```\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n ADDITIONAL DISCOVERY\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n Common Tables Not in Schema (testing existence):\n ├── _prisma_migrations: ❌ Not found\n ├── schema_migrations: ❌ Not found\n ├── audit_log: ✅ EXISTS but not in OpenAPI\n └── internal_config: ❌ Not found\n\n Note: ''audit_log'' exists but may have restricted access.\n       Test with supabase-audit-tables-read.\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n```\n\n## Schema Analysis\n\nThe skill also checks for non-public schemas:\n\n```\nSchema Exposure Check:\n├── public: ✅ Exposed (8 tables)\n├── auth: ❌ Not directly exposed (expected)\n├── storage: ❌ Not directly exposed (expected)\n├── extensions: ❌ Not exposed (good)\n└── custom_schema: ⚠️ Exposed (3 tables) - Review if intentional\n```\n\n## Common Issues\n\n❌ **Problem:** No tables found\n✅ **Solution:**\n- Check if anon key is valid\n- Verify project URL is correct\n- The API may be disabled in project settings\n\n❌ **Problem:** Too many tables listed\n✅ **Solution:** This may indicate overly permissive schema exposure. Consider:\n```sql\n-- Restrict exposed schemas\nALTER ROLE anon SET search_path TO public;\n```\n\n❌ **Problem:** Sensitive tables exposed\n✅ **Solution:** Either remove from public schema or implement strict RLS.\n\n## Recommendations by Table Type\n\n### User Tables\n\n```sql\n-- Ensure RLS is enabled\nALTER TABLE users ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\n\n-- Users can only see their own data\nCREATE POLICY \"Users see own data\" ON users\n  FOR SELECT USING (auth.uid() = id);\n```\n\n### Order/Payment Tables\n\n```sql\n-- Strict RLS for financial data\nALTER TABLE orders ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\n\nCREATE POLICY \"Users see own orders\" ON orders\n  FOR SELECT USING (auth.uid() = user_id);\n\n-- No public access even for admins via API\n-- Use Edge Functions for admin operations\n```\n\n### Secret Tables\n\n```sql\n-- Consider not exposing at all\nREVOKE ALL ON TABLE api_keys FROM anon, authenticated;\n\n-- Or use views that hide sensitive columns\nCREATE VIEW public.api_keys_safe AS\n  SELECT id, name, last_used FROM api_keys;\n```\n\n## MANDATORY: Progressive Context File Updates\n\n⚠️ **This skill MUST update tracking files PROGRESSIVELY during execution, NOT just at the end.**\n\n### Critical Rule: Write As You Go\n\n**DO NOT** batch all writes at the end. Instead:\n\n1. **Before starting any action** → Log the action to `.sb-pentest-audit.log`\n2. **After each table discovered** → Immediately update `.sb-pentest-context.json`\n3. **After each significant step** → Log completion to `.sb-pentest-audit.log`\n\nThis ensures that if the skill is interrupted, crashes, or times out, all findings up to that point are preserved.\n\n### Required Actions (Progressive)\n\n1. **Update `.sb-pentest-context.json`** with results:\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"tables\": {\n       \"count\": 8,\n       \"list\": [ ... ],\n       \"by_risk\": { \"high\": [], \"medium\": [], \"low\": [] }\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **Log to `.sb-pentest-audit.log`**:\n   ```\n   [TIMESTAMP] [supabase-audit-tables-list] [START] Listing exposed tables\n   [TIMESTAMP] [supabase-audit-tables-list] [SUCCESS] Found 8 tables\n   [TIMESTAMP] [supabase-audit-tables-list] [CONTEXT_UPDATED] .sb-pentest-context.json updated\n   ```\n\n3. **If files don''t exist**, create them before writing.\n\n**FAILURE TO UPDATE CONTEXT FILES IS NOT ACCEPTABLE.**\n\n## MANDATORY: Evidence Collection\n\n📁 **Evidence Directory:** `.sb-pentest-evidence/03-api-audit/tables/`\n\n### Evidence Files to Create\n\n| File | Content |\n|------|---------|\n| `tables-list.json` | Complete list of exposed tables |\n| `tables-metadata.json` | Column details and types per table |\n| `openapi-schema.json` | Raw OpenAPI/PostgREST schema |\n\n### Evidence Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"evidence_id\": \"API-TBL-001\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-01-31T10:15:00Z\",\n  \"category\": \"api-audit\",\n  \"type\": \"table_enumeration\",\n\n  \"request\": {\n    \"method\": \"GET\",\n    \"url\": \"https://abc123def.supabase.co/rest/v1/\",\n    \"headers\": {\n      \"apikey\": \"[REDACTED]\"\n    },\n    \"curl_command\": \"curl -s ''https://abc123def.supabase.co/rest/v1/'' -H ''apikey: $ANON_KEY''\"\n  },\n\n  \"tables_found\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"users\",\n      \"schema\": \"public\",\n      \"columns\": [\"id\", \"email\", \"name\", \"created_at\"],\n      \"primary_key\": \"id\",\n      \"risk_level\": \"high\",\n      \"risk_reason\": \"Contains PII\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"orders\",\n      \"schema\": \"public\",\n      \"columns\": [\"id\", \"user_id\", \"total\", \"status\"],\n      \"primary_key\": \"id\",\n      \"risk_level\": \"high\",\n      \"risk_reason\": \"Financial data\"\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"total_tables\": 8,\n    \"high_risk\": 2,\n    \"medium_risk\": 3,\n    \"low_risk\": 3\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Add to curl-commands.sh\n\n```bash\n# === TABLE ENUMERATION ===\n# List all exposed tables via OpenAPI schema\ncurl -s \"$SUPABASE_URL/rest/v1/\" -H \"apikey: $ANON_KEY\"\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `supabase-audit-tables-read` — Test actual data access\n- `supabase-audit-rls` — Verify RLS policies\n- `supabase-audit-rpc` — Check exposed functions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:58:20.953Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Supabase auditing and table listing capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级 Supabase 审计和表格列出功能的安全代理。","ja":"Supabase の高度な監査とテーブル リスト機能を必要とするセキュリティ エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Supabase 감사 및 테이블 목록 기능이 필요한 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de seguridad que necesitan capacidades de auditoría avanzadas de Supabase y listado de tablas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de sécurité ayant besoin de capacités d''audit avancées de Supabase et de listage de tables.","de":"Perfekt für Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Supabase-Prüf- und Tabellenauflistungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança que necessitam de auditoria avançada do Supabase e capacidades de listagem de tabelas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности, которым необходима расширенная аудит Supabase и возможности перечисления таблиц.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الأمن الذين يحتاجون إلى تدقيق متقدم من Supabase وقدرات قائمة الجدول."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to list exposed tables in Supabase while maintaining a secure audit trail through progressive updates to `.sb-pentest-context.json` and logging to `.sb-pentest-audit.log`, utilizing protocols for secure data handling.","zh":"赋予代理在 Supabase 中列出暴露表格的能力，同时通过 `.sb-pentest-context.json` 和 `.sb-pentest-audit.log` 的进步更新来保持安全的审计跟踪，利用安全数据处理协议。","ja":"エージェントに Supabase で公開されているテーブルをリストする機能を提供し、`.sb-pentest-context.json` と `.sb-pentest-audit.log` の進歩的な更新を通じて、セキュアな監査トレイルを維持し、セキュアなデータ処理プロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Supabase에서 노출된 표를 목록으로 만들 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, `.sb-pentest-context.json` 및 `.sb-pentest-audit.log`의 점진적인 업데이트를 통해 보안 감사 추적을 유지하고, 보안 데이터 처리 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a listar tablas expuestas en Supabase manteniendo un registro de auditoría seguro a través de actualizaciones progresivas a `.sb-pentest-context.json` y registro en `.sb-pentest-audit.log`, utilizando protocolos para el manejo seguro de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lister les tables exposées dans Supabase tout en maintenant un traçage d''audit sécurisé grâce à des mises à jour progressives de `.sb-pentest-context.json` et à la journalisation dans `.sb-pentest-audit.log`, en utilisant des protocoles pour la gestion sécurisée des données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, in Supabase exponierte Tabellen aufzulisten und dabei eine sichere Prüfungsprotokollverfolgung durch progressive Updates von `.sb-pentest-context.json` und Protokollierung in `.sb-pentest-audit.log` zu gewährleisten, unter Verwendung von Protokollen für die sichere Datenverwaltung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a listarem tabelas expostas no Supabase, mantendo um rastro de auditoria seguro por meio de atualizações progressivas para `.sb-pentest-context.json` e registro em `.sb-pentest-audit.log`, utilizando protocolos para manipulação segura de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью перечислять открытые таблицы в Supabase, сохраняя при этом безопасный аудиторский след посредством прогрессивных обновлений `.sb-pentest-context.json` и ведения журнала в `.sb-pentest-audit.log`, используя протоколы для безопасной обработки данных.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من قائمة الجداول المعرضة في Supabase مع الحفاظ على سجل تدقيق آمن من خلال تحديثات تدريجية إلى `.sb-pentest-context.json` وتسجيل إلى `.sb-pentest-audit.log` ، باستخدام بروتوكولات لمعالجة البيانات الآمنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Listing exposed tables in Supabase for vulnerability assessment","Generating audit logs for security compliance and transparency","Updating context files progressively for secure auditing and data integrity"],"zh":["用于漏洞评估的 Supabase 中暴露表格的列表","用于安全合规和透明度的审计日志生成","用于安全审计和数据完整性的上下文文件的进步更新"],"ja":["脆弱性評価のための Supabase の公開テーブルのリスト","セキュリティ コンプライアンスと透明性のための監査ログの生成","セキュアな監査とデータの完全性のためのコンテキスト ファイルの進歩的な更新"],"ko":["취약성 평가를 위한 Supabase의 노출된 표의 목록","보안 규정 준수 및 투명성의審計 로그 생성","보안 감사 및 데이터 무결성의 컨텍스트 파일의 점진적 업데이트"],"es":["Listado de tablas expuestas en Supabase para evaluación de vulnerabilidad","Generación de registros de auditoría para cumplimiento y transparencia de seguridad","Actualización progresiva de archivos de contexto para auditoría y integridad de datos seguras"],"fr":["Listage des tables exposées dans Supabase pour évaluation de vulnérabilité","Génération de journaux d''audit pour conformité et transparence de sécurité","Mise à jour progressive des fichiers de contexte pour audit et intégrité des données sécurisées"],"de":["Auflistung exponierter Tabellen in Supabase für Schwachstellenbewertung","Erzeugung von Prüfungsprotokollen für Sicherheitskonformität und Transparenz","Schrittweise Aktualisierung von Kontextdateien für sichere Prüfung und Datenintegrität"],"pt":["Listagem de tabelas expostas no Supabase para avaliação de vulnerabilidade","Geração de registros de auditoria para conformidade e transparência de segurança","Atualização progressiva de arquivos de contexto para auditoria segura e integridade de dados"],"ru":["Перечисление открытых таблиц в Supabase для оценки уязвимости","Генерация журналов аудита для безопасности и прозрачности","Прогрессивное обновление файлов контекста для безопасного аудита и целостности данных"],"ar":["قائمة الجداول المعرضة في Supabase لتقييم الضعف","генерация سجلات التدقيق لأمن وشفافية","تحديث ملفات السياق تدريجيا لأمن التدقيق وسلامة البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires progressive file updates to `.sb-pentest-context.json`","Mandatory logging to `.sb-pentest-audit.log` before and after each action","Supabase-specific, may not be compatible with other database systems"],"zh":[".sb-pentest-context.json 的进步文件更新是必需的","在每个操作之前和之后都必须记录到 .sb-pentest-audit.log","特定于 Supabase，可能与其他数据库系统不兼容"],"ja":[".sb-pentest-context.json の進歩的なファイル更新が必要","各アクションの前後で .sb-pentest-audit.log にログを記録することが必須","Supabase 専用で、他のデータベース システムと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":[".sb-pentest-context.json의 점진적 파일 업데이트가 필요","각 작업 전후에 .sb-pentest-audit.log에 로그를 기록해야 함","Supabase 전용으로, 다른 데이터베이스 시스템과 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere actualizaciones progresivas de archivos a `.sb-pentest-context.json`","Registro obligatorio en `.sb-pentest-audit.log` antes y después de cada acción","Específico de Supabase, puede que no sea compatible con otros sistemas de bases de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite des mises à jour progressives de fichiers vers `.sb-pentest-context.json`","Journalisation obligatoire dans `.sb-pentest-audit.log` avant et après chaque action","Spécifique à Supabase, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres systèmes de bases de données"],"de":["Benötigt schrittweise Dateiaktualisierungen zu `.sb-pentest-context.json`","Pflichtprotokollierung in `.sb-pentest-audit.log` vor und nach jeder Aktion","Spezifisch für Supabase, möglicherweise nicht kompatibel mit anderen Datenbanksystemen"],"pt":["Requer atualizações progressivas de arquivos para `.sb-pentest-context.json`","Registro obrigatório em `.sb-pentest-audit.log` antes e após cada ação","Específico do Supabase, pode não ser compatível com outros sistemas de banco de dados"],"ru":["Требует прогрессивных обновлений файлов для `.sb-pentest-context.json`","Обязательный лог в `.sb-pentest-audit.log` до и после каждого действия","Спецефичный для Supabase, может быть несовместим с другими системами баз данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تحديثات ملفات تدريجية إلى `.sb-pentest-context.json`","تسجيل إلزامي في `.sb-pentest-audit.log` قبل وأثناء كل إجراء","محدد من Supabase ، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع أنظمة قواعد البيانات الأخرى"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"9bb41b6c3ec884acfdfb5846ebf5e205456737cc822da3f70f24f1cea72f9904","qualityScore":60}');
