on Requires progressive file updates to ensure data integrity Supports secure auditing by logging all actions and discoveries Ensures data persistence in case of skill crashes or interruptions supabase-audit-tables-list is a critical AI agent skill that ensures progressive file updates and logging for secure audit table listing in Supabase environments.');
