ct 19 + TypeScript构建的前端UI组件集合","ja":"UIコンポーネントは、React 19 + TypeScriptで構築されたフロントエンドUIコンポーネントの集合です","ko":"UI 컴포넌트 라이브러리는 React 19 및 TypeScript로 구축된 프론트엔드 UI 컴포넌트의 모음입니다","es":"Componentes de interfaz de usuario son elementos reutilizables que facilitan la creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas con tecnologías como React y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Les composants d''interface utilisateur sont des éléments réutilisables qui facilitent la création d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées avec des technologies comme React et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten sind wiederverwendbare Elemente, die die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen mit Technologien wie React und Tailwind CSS erleichtern.","pt":"UI Components é um conjunto de elementos de interface de usuário reutilizáveis construídos com tecnologias web modernas","ru":"ИИ Агенты UI Компоненты - это набор многократно используемых элементов интерфейса пользователя, построенных на современных веб-технологиях","ar":"مكونات الواجهة البصرية هي مجموعة من عناصر واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام التي يتم بناؤها باستخدام تقنيات الويب الحديثة"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes React 19 as the UI framework","Employs TypeScript 5.9 for type safety","Leverages Tailwind CSS 4 for utility-first styling via @tailwindcss/vite plugin","Incorporates Framer Motion 12 for component animations","Organizes components in src/components/ and pages in src/pages/","Supports a dark detective-themed design system"],"zh":["使用React 19作为UI框架","采用TypeScript 5.9实现类型安全","集成Tailwind CSS 4进行实用性优先的样式设置","使用Framer Motion 12实现组件动画","支持dark detective主题设计系统"],"ja":["React 19をUIフレームワークとして使用","TypeScript 5.9を使用して型安全性を実現","Tailwind CSS 4を使用してユーティリティファーストのスタイリングを実現","Framer Motion 12を使用してコンポーネントアニメーションを実現","ダークデザイナーテーマ設計システムをサポート"],"ko":["React 19을 UI 프레임워크로 사용","TypeScript 5.9를 사용하여 타입 안전성을 구현","Tailwind CSS 4를 사용하여 유틸리티 우선의 스타일링을 구현","Framer Motion 12를 사용하여 컴포넌트 애니메이션을 구현","다크 디자인 테마 디자인 시스템을 지원"],"es":["React 19 como framework de interfaz de usuario","TypeScript para seguridad de tipos","Tailwind CSS 4 para estilos de utilidad","Animaciones de Framer Motion para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Diseño de sistema temático de detective oscuro","Compatibilidad con Vite"],"fr":["React 19 comme framework d''interface utilisateur","TypeScript pour la sécurité des types","Tailwind CSS 4 pour les styles de commodité","Animations Framer Motion pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur","Conception de système de thème de détective sombre","Compatibilité avec Vite"],"de":["React 19 als Benutzeroberflächenframework","TypeScript für Typsicherheit","Tailwind CSS 4 für Utility-Styles","Framer Motion-Animationen für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung","Dunkles Detektiv-Designsystem","Kompatibilität mit Vite"],"pt":["React 19 como framework de interface de usuário","TypeScript para segurança de tipo","Tailwind CSS 4 para estilização utility-first","Framer Motion para animações de componentes","Design system com tema de detetive sombrio"],"ru":["React 19 в качестве фреймворка интерфейса пользователя","TypeScript для обеспечения безопасности типов","Tailwind CSS 4 для утилитарной стилизации","Framer Motion для анимаций компонентов","Дизайн-система с темой темного детектива"],"ar":["React 19 كإطار عمل لواجهة المستخدم","TypeScript لضمان سلامة النوع","Tailwind CSS 4 لتصميم واجهة المستخدم الأولى","Framer Motion للرسوم المتحركة للمكونات","نظام التصميم مع موضوع المحقق المظلم"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ui-components","ui-components setup guide","ui-components alternative","ui-components vs Material UI","ui-components install","what is ui-components","ui-components react","ui-components typescript","ui-components tailwind css"],"zh":["UI组件库","React 19","TypeScript 5.9","Tailwind CSS 4","Framer Motion 12","前端开发","UI设计","AI工具","AIエージェント"],"ja":["UIコンポーネント","React 19","TypeScript 5.9","Tailwind CSS 4","Framer Motion 12","フロントエンド開発","UIデザイン","AIエージェント","AIツール"],"ko":["UI 컴포넌트 라이브러리","React 19","TypeScript 5.9","Tailwind CSS 4","Framer Motion 12","프론트엔드 개발","UI 디자인","AI 에이전트","AI 툴"],"es":["componentes de interfaz de usuario","react 19","typescript","tailwind css 4","framer motion","diseño de sistema temático","vite","desarrollo de interfaz de usuario","experiencia del usuario","animaciones de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["composants d''interface utilisateur","react 19","typescript","tailwind css 4","framer motion","conception de système de thème","vite","développement d''interface utilisateur","expérience utilisateur","animations d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","react 19","typescript","tailwind css 4","framer motion","dunkles detektiv-designsystem","vite","entwicklung von benutzeroberflächen","benutzererfahrung","benutzeroberflächenanimationen"],"pt":["ui components","react 19","typescript","tailwind css 4","framer motion","design system","interface de usuário","componentes de interface","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","ui компоненты","react 19","typescript","tailwind css 4","framer motion","дизайн-система","интерфейс пользователя","компоненты интерфейса","веб-разработка"],"ar":["مكونات الواجهة البصرية","react 19","typescript","tailwind css 4","framer motion","نظام التصميم","واجهة المستخدم","مكونات الواجهة","تطوير الويب","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"seanchiuai","repo":"trace","repoPath":"seanchiuai/trace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T04:01:19Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-components","description":"React component architecture, dark theme design system, and animation patterns","bodyPreview":"# UI Components\n\n## Overview\n\nReact 19 + TypeScript frontend with Tailwind CSS 4, Framer Motion animations, and a dark detective-themed design system. All components in `src/components/`, pages in `src/pages/`.\n\n## Stack\n\n| Library | Version | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| React | 19 | UI framework |\n| TypeScript | 5.9 | Type safety |\n| Tailwind CSS | 4 | Utility-first styling (via `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin) |\n| Framer Motion | 12 | Component animations (enter/exit, spring, layout","body":"# UI Components\n\n## Overview\n\nReact 19 + TypeScript frontend with Tailwind CSS 4, Framer Motion animations, and a dark detective-themed design system. All components in `src/components/`, pages in `src/pages/`.\n\n## Stack\n\n| Library | Version | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| React | 19 | UI framework |\n| TypeScript | 5.9 | Type safety |\n| Tailwind CSS | 4 | Utility-first styling (via `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin) |\n| Framer Motion | 12 | Component animations (enter/exit, spring, layout) |\n| React Router DOM | 7 | Client routing (`/`, `/runs`, `/investigate/:id`, `/report/:id`) |\n\n## Design System\n\n### Colors (CSS custom properties via `@theme`)\n\nDefined in `src/index.css`:\n\n| Token | Value | Usage |\n|-------|-------|-------|\n| `bg-primary` | `#07070c` | Page background (near-black with blue undertone) |\n| `bg-secondary` | `#0d0d14` | Section backgrounds |\n| `bg-card` | `#13131f` | Cards, inputs, containers |\n| `bg-card-hover` | `#191928` | Card hover state |\n| `bg-elevated` | `#1a1a2a` | Modals, dropdowns |\n| `border` | `#1e1e32` | Default borders |\n| `border-bright` | `#2e2e4a` | Hover/active borders |\n| `border-accent` | `rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.2)` | Accent-tinted borders |\n| `accent` | `#00ff88` | CTA buttons, active indicators, highlights |\n| `accent-dim` | `#00cc6a` | Accent hover state |\n| `accent-glow` | `rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.15)` | Glow effects |\n| `accent-bright` | `#33ffaa` | Bright accent for button hover |\n| `danger` | `#ff3b4f` | Errors, low confidence (<40%) |\n| `warning` | `#ffb224` | Medium confidence (40-79%) |\n| `info` | `#3b82f6` | Planning status |\n| `success` | `#00ff88` | Alias for accent |\n| `text-primary` | `#e4e4ef` | Main body text |\n| `text-secondary` | `#7e7e9a` | Labels, secondary info |\n| `text-muted` | `#4a4a66` | Placeholders, hints |\n| `text-accent` | `#00ff88` | Accent-colored text |\n\n### Typography\n\nTwo font families:\n\n| Role | Font | Usage |\n|------|------|-------|\n| Display | `Outfit` (300-900) | Headings, hero text, stat numbers, CTA buttons |\n| Data | `JetBrains Mono` (300-700) | Labels, metadata, code, timestamps, body text |\n\n```css\n--font-display: \"Outfit\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n--font-mono: \"JetBrains Mono\", \"Fira Code\", monospace;\n```\n\nUse `.font-display` for Outfit, `font-mono` (default body) for JetBrains Mono.\n\n## Component Inventory\n\n| Component | File | Purpose |\n|-----------|------|---------|\n| `InputForm` | `src/components/InputForm.tsx` | Investigation submission form with extreme mode toggle |\n| `BrowserView` | `src/components/BrowserView.tsx` | Live browser iframe with floating LIVE pill + URL label |\n| `ActivityStream` | `src/components/ActivityStream.tsx` | Step sub-components (CollapsedStep, ExpandedStep, ToolBadge) |\n| `FindingsGrid` | `src/components/FindingsGrid.tsx` | Evidence cards with confidence bars and category badges |\n| `DetectiveReport` | `src/components/DetectiveReport.tsx` | Dossier-style report with stats, evidence, image gallery, typewriter effect |\n| `LeadTree` | `src/components/LeadTree.tsx` | Connection network (superseded by RelationshipGraph) |\n| `ImageGallery` | `src/components/ImageGallery.tsx` | Found images grid (superseded by inline gallery in DetectiveReport) |\n| `HudHeader` | `src/components/HudHeader.tsx` | Investigation HUD header with status, steps, cost, tokens |\n| `CommandStrip` | `src/components/CommandStrip.tsx` | Collapsible bottom activity stream strip |\n| `FindingToasts` | `src/components/FindingToasts.tsx` | Real-time finding notification toasts + slide-out tray |\n| `CompletionFlash` | `src/components/CompletionFlash.tsx` | Full-screen investigation completion overlay |\n| `BehavioralProfile` | `src/components/BehavioralProfile.tsx` | Behavioral analysis cards (timezone, username patterns, predicted handles) |\n| `GeoIntelMap` | `src/components/GeoIntelMap.tsx` | Leaflet map with confidence-colored markers for geo-located findings |\n| `RelationshipGraph` | `src/components/RelationshipGraph.tsx` | Force-directed 2D graph (react-force-graph-2d) for relationship visualization |\n| `ViewSwitcher` | `src/components/ViewSwitcher.tsx` | Vertical toolbar to switch Browser/Graph/Map views with pulse indicators |\n\n### Hooks\n\n| Hook | File | Purpose |\n|------|------|---------|\n| `useGraphData` | `src/hooks/useGraphData.ts` | Transforms findings + graph edges into nodes/links for RelationshipGraph |\n\n## Pages\n\n| Page | Route | Layout |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `Home` | `/` | Header (with All Runs link) -> Hero -> InputForm -> Disclaimer |\n| `Runs` | `/runs` | Card grid of all investigations with status, confidence, time, cost |\n| `Investigation` | `/investigate/:id` | Layered HUD: ambient bg -> ViewSwitcher (Browser/Graph/Map) -> HudHeader (floating) -> FindingToasts (floating) -> CommandStrip (bottom) -> CompletionFlash (overlay) |\n| `Report` | `/report/:id` | DetectiveReport with stats, evidence, behavioral profile, image gallery |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Section header (most repeated pattern)\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-5\">\n  <div className=\"h-px w-3 bg-accent/30\" />\n  <h3 className=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-text-secondary tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-mono\">\n    {label}\n  </h3>\n  <span className=\"text-[10px] text-text-muted font-mono tabular-nums\">{count}</span>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Input styling\n\n```tsx\n<input\n  className=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-bg-card/80 border rounded-lg text-text-primary text-sm\n             placeholder:text-text-muted/60 focus:outline-none transition-all duration-300\n             border-border hover:border-border-bright\n             focus:border-accent/40 focus:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,255,136,0.06)]\"\n/>\n```\n\n### Card styling\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"relative bg-bg-card/60 border border-border/60 rounded-lg p-3\n                hover:border-border-bright hover:bg-bg-card-hover transition-all duration-200 group\">\n```\n\n### Label styling\n\n```tsx\n<span className=\"text-[10px] text-text-secondary tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-mono\">\n```\n\n### HUD corner brackets\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-t border-l border-accent/15 rounded-tl-xl pointer-events-none\" />\n<div className=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-r border-accent/15 rounded-br-xl pointer-events-none\" />\n```\n\nAlso available as `.hud-corners` CSS class in `index.css`.\n\n### Glass surface\n\n```css\n.glass { backdrop-filter: blur(12px); background: rgba(7,7,12,0.7); }\n.glass-accent { backdrop-filter: blur(12px); background: rgba(0,255,136,0.08); }\n```\n\n### Loading spinner\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"relative w-12 h-12\">\n  <div className=\"absolute inset-0 border-2 border-accent/20 rounded-full\" />\n  <div className=\"absolute inset-0 border-2 border-transparent border-t-accent rounded-full animate-spin\" />\n</div>\n<span className=\"text-[10px] text-text-muted tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-mono\">Loading...</span>\n```\n\n### Animated list items (Framer Motion)\n\n```tsx\n<AnimatePresence mode=\"popLayout\">\n  {items.map((item) => (\n    <motion.div\n      key={item._id}\n      initial={{ opacity: 0, x: -12 }}\n      animate={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}\n      transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}\n    >\n      {/* content */}\n    </motion.div>\n  ))}\n</AnimatePresence>\n```\n\n### Confidence color coding\n\n```typescript\n// Used across FindingsGrid, DetectiveReport, Runs\n// Takes prefix param (\"text-\" or \"bg-\") for flexibility\nif (confidence >= 80) return `${prefix}accent`;     // green\nif (confidence >= 60) return `${prefix}yellow-400`;  // or text-warning in DetectiveReport\nif (confidence >= 40) return `${prefix}orange-400`;\nreturn `${prefix}danger`;                            // red, < 40%\n```\n\n### Category badge colors\n\n```typescript\nconst CATEGORY_STYLE: Record<string, { bg: string; text: string; border: string; dot: string }> = {\n  social:     { bg: \"bg-blue-500/8\",    text: \"text-blue-400\",    border: \"border-blue-500/20\",    dot: \"bg-blue-400\" },\n  connection: { bg: \"bg-purple-500/8\",  text: \"text-purple-400\",  border: \"border-purple-500/20\",  dot: \"bg-purple-400\" },\n  location:   { bg: \"bg-green-500/8\",   text: \"text-green-400\",   border: \"border-green-500/20\",   dot: \"bg-green-400\" },\n  activity:   { bg: \"bg-yellow-500/8\",  text: \"text-yellow-400\",  border: \"border-yellow-500/20\",  dot: \"bg-yellow-400\" },\n  identity:   { bg: \"bg-cyan-500/8\",    text: \"text-cyan-400\",    border: \"border-cyan-500/20\",    dot: \"bg-cyan-400\" },\n};\n```\n\n### Tool icons in ActivityStream\n\nSingle-letter abbreviations with tool-specific colors (includes `bg` and `border` fields):\n\n| Tool | Letter | Color |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| reasoning | R | `text-purple-400` |\n| maigret | M | `text-blue-400` |\n| browser_action | B | `text-cyan-400` |\n| web_search | W | `text-orange-400` |\n| save_finding | S | `text-yellow-400` |\n| geo_locate | G | `text-green-400` |\n| whitepages | P | `text-red-400` |\n| reverse_image | I | `text-pink-400` |\n| darkweb | D | `text-red-500` |\n\n### BrowserView States\n\n| State | Condition | Display |\n|-------|-----------|---------|\n| Planning | `status === \"planning\"`, no URL | Globe icon + \"Waiting for investigation to initialize...\" |\n| Connecting | `status === \"investigating\"`, no URL | Status dot + \"Connecting to browser\" |\n| Active | `liveUrl` present | Floating \"Live\" pill (top-right) + URL label (bottom-left) + full-height iframe |\n\n## CSS Animations (in `src/index.css`)\n\n| Name | Effect |\n|------|--------|\n| `pulse` | Opacity 1->0.5->1 |\n| `horizontalScan` | Left-to-right sweep with fade |\n| `float` | Subtle vertical float |\n| `cursorBlink` | Typing cursor blink (step function) |\n| `gridFadeIn` | Fade opacity 0->0.04 |\n| `dataStream` | Vertical translateY scroll |\n| `radarSweep` | 360 degree rotation |\n| `vignetteBreath` | Pulsing vignette box-shadow (4s) |\n| `toastGlow` | Toast entrance flash with box-shadow (0.6s) |\n| `drawCheck` | SVG stroke-dashoffset to 0 |\n| `progressShimmer` | Background-position shimmer |\n| `typewriterCursor` | Border-right color blink |\n| `stampSlam` | Scale 3->0.9->1.05->1 with rotation (0.6s) |\n| `dossierScan` | Top-to-bottom scan line (3s/8s) |\n| `ringDraw` | SVG stroke-dashoffset ring draw |\n| `redactFlicker` | Opacity flicker 0.06->0.12 |\n\n## Atmospheric Effects\n\n- **Film grain**: `body::before` with SVG noise at 2.5% opacity\n- **Grid background**: `.grid-bg` class or inline styles with green-tinted grid lines (40-60px)\n- **Radial glow**: Accent-colored radial gradient on hero sections\n\n## Convex Integration\n\nFrontend uses Convex React hooks:\n\n```tsx\n// Queries (real-time subscriptions)\nconst investigation = useQuery(api.investigations.get, { id });\nconst steps = useQuery(api.investigations.getSteps, { investigationId });\nconst findings = useQuery(api.investigations.getFindings, { investigationId });\nconst edges = useQuery(api.graphEdges.getEdges, { investigationId });\nconst allInvestigations = useQuery(api.investigations.list);\nconst report = useQuery(api.reports.getReport, { investigationId });\n\n// Mutations\nconst createInvestigation = useMutation(api.investigations.create);\n\n// Actions\nconst startInvestigation = useAction(api.orchestrator.startInvestigation);\n```\n\n`useQuery` returns reactive data — components re-render automatically when Convex data changes.\n\n## Gotchas\n\n- **Tailwind v4**: Uses `@theme` directive in CSS instead of `tailwind.config.js`. Plugin is `@tailwindcss/vite`, not PostCSS.\n- **No App.css**: Removed default Vite styles. All styling via Tailwind utilities in `index.css`.\n- **Convex provider**: Must wrap app in `<ConvexProvider client={convex}>` in `App.tsx`\n- **Route params**: `useParams<{ id: string }>()` returns string, cast to `Id<\"investigations\">` for Convex\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:58:59.963Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring advanced UI component customization with React 19 and TypeScript","zh":"适用于需要使用 React 19 和 TypeScript 进行高级 UI 组件自定义的前端代理","ja":"React 19 と TypeScript を使用した高度な UI コンポーネントのカスタマイズが必要なフロントエンド エージェントに適しています","ko":"React 19와 TypeScript를 사용하여 고급 UI 컴포넌트 커스터마이징이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requieren personalización avanzada de componentes de interfaz de usuario con React 19 y TypeScript","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant une personnalisation avancée des composants d''interface utilisateur avec React 19 et TypeScript","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Anpassung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit React 19 und TypeScript benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem personalização avançada de componentes de UI com React 19 e TypeScript","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, требующих продвинутой настройки компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью React 19 и TypeScript","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامي الذي يتطلب تخصيصًا متقدمًا لمكونات واجهة المستخدم مع React 19 وTypeScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create responsive, dark detective-themed interfaces using Tailwind CSS 4 and Framer Motion animations, enabling seamless integration of utility-first styling and component animations into their workflows","zh":"赋予代理创建响应式、黑暗侦探主题的接口的能力，使用 Tailwind CSS 4 和 Framer Motion 动画，使得实用性优先的样式和组件动画能够无缝集成到工作流中","ja":"Tailwind CSS 4 と Framer Motion アニメーションを使用して、レスポンシブでダーク ディテクティブ テーマのインターフェイスを作成する機能をエージェントに与え、ユーティリティ ファーストのスタイリングとコンポーネント アニメーションをワークフローにシームレスに統合できるようにする","ko":"Tailwind CSS 4와 Framer Motion 애니메이션을 사용하여 반응형, 다크 디텍티브 테마의 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여, 유틸리티 우선의 스타일과 컴포넌트 애니메이션을 워크플로에无缝로 통합할 수 있게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces responsivas con un tema de detective oscuro utilizando Tailwind CSS 4 y animaciones de Framer Motion, lo que permite una integración sin problemas del estilo de utilidad y las animaciones de componentes en sus flujos de trabajo","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces réactives avec un thème de détective sombre en utilisant Tailwind CSS 4 et les animations Framer Motion, ce qui permet une intégration sans heurts du style de première utilité et des animations de composants dans leurs flux de travail","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, responsiv, dunkel gehaltene detektivische Schnittstellen mit Tailwind CSS 4 und Framer-Motion-Animationen zu erstellen, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration von Utility-First-Styling und Komponentenanimationen in ihre Workflows ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem interfaces responsivas com tema de detetive sombrio usando Tailwind CSS 4 e animações Framer Motion, permitindo a integração sem problemas de estilização de utilidade e animações de componentes em seus fluxos de trabalho","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отзывчивые интерфейсы с темой темного детектива, используя Tailwind CSS 4 и анимации Framer Motion, что позволяет обеспечить бесшовную интеграцию стиля, ориентированного на утилиты, и анимаций компонентов в их рабочих процессах","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مستجيبة ذات طابع محقق مظلم باستخدام Tailwind CSS 4 وحركات Framer Motion، مما يمكّن من دمج أسلوب الاستخدام الأول للوظيفة وتحركات المكونات في سير عملهم بشكل متماسك"},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom UI components with React 19 and TypeScript","Implementing dark detective-themed design systems using Tailwind CSS 4","Adding interactive animations to UI components with Framer Motion"],"zh":["使用 React 19 和 TypeScript 构建自定义 UI 组件","使用 Tailwind CSS 4 实现黑暗侦探主题的设计系统","使用 Framer Motion 将交互式动画添加到 UI 组件"],"ja":["React 19 と TypeScript を使用してカスタム UI コンポーネントを構築する","Tailwind CSS 4 を使用してダーク ディテクティブ テーマのデザイン システムを実装する","Framer Motion を使用して UI コンポーネントにインタラクティブ アニメーションを追加する"],"ko":["React 19와 TypeScript를 사용하여 커스텀 UI 컴포넌트를 구축","Tailwind CSS 4를 사용하여 다크 디텍티브 테마의 디자인 시스템을 구현","Framer Motion을 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트에 상호작용 애니메이션을 추가"],"es":["Creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados con React 19 y TypeScript","Implementación de sistemas de diseño con tema de detective oscuro utilizando Tailwind CSS 4","Adición de animaciones interactivas a los componentes de interfaz de usuario con Framer Motion"],"fr":["Création de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés avec React 19 et TypeScript","Mise en œuvre de systèmes de conception avec un thème de détective sombre en utilisant Tailwind CSS 4","Ajout d''animations interactives aux composants d''interface utilisateur avec Framer Motion"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit React 19 und TypeScript","Implementierung von Designsystemen mit dunklem Detektiv-Thema unter Verwendung von Tailwind CSS 4","Hinzufügen interaktiver Animationen zu Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Framer Motion"],"pt":["Construir componentes de UI personalizados com React 19 e TypeScript","Implementar sistemas de design com tema de detetive sombrio usando Tailwind CSS 4","Adicionar animações interativas a componentes de UI com Framer Motion"],"ru":["Построение пользовательских компонентов интерфейса с помощью React 19 и TypeScript","Реализация систем дизайна с темой темного детектива, используя Tailwind CSS 4","Добавление интерактивных анимаций к компонентам интерфейса с помощью Framer Motion"],"ar":["بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة باستخدام React 19 وTypeScript","تطبيق أنظمة التصميم ذات طابع المحقق المظلم باستخدام Tailwind CSS 4","إضافة التحركات التفاعلية إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم باستخدام Framer Motion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React 19 and TypeScript compatibility","Limited to frontend development with Tailwind CSS 4 and Framer Motion"],"zh":["需要 React 19 和 TypeScript 兼容性","仅限于使用 Tailwind CSS 4 和 Framer Motion 的前端开发"],"ja":["React 19 と TypeScript の互換性が必要","Tailwind CSS 4 と Framer Motion を使用したフロントエンド開発のみに限定される"],"ko":["React 19와 TypeScript 호환성이 필요","Tailwind CSS 4와 Framer Motion을 사용한 프론트엔드 개발에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con React 19 y TypeScript","Limitado al desarrollo frontend con Tailwind CSS 4 y Framer Motion"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec React 19 et TypeScript","Limité au développement frontend avec Tailwind CSS 4 et Framer Motion"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit React 19 und TypeScript","Begrenzt auf die Frontend-Entwicklung mit Tailwind CSS 4 und Framer Motion"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com React 19 e TypeScript","Limitado ao desenvolvimento frontend com Tailwind CSS 4 e Framer Motion"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с React 19 и TypeScript","Ограничен разработкой frontend с помощью Tailwind CSS 4 и Framer Motion"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع React 19 وTypeScript","محدود بالتطوير الأمامي مع Tailwind CSS 4 وFramer Motion"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c32a1733c52db7799e0f551e78f899c3fa7bf2c2e66244194a6aedf4e090bc7a","qualityScore":60}');
